;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es": {"🎮 Game modes — pick how your quiz plays": "🎮 Modos de juego — elige cómo se juega tu cuestionario", "🎮 Game modes": "🎮 Modos de juego", "When you hit Present, PollSlide asks how you want to run it. Classic works exactly as it always has. The other four change how points are scored and what the big screen celebrates — same questions, completely different energy in the room.": "Al pulsar Presentar, PollSlide te pregunta cómo quieres jugarlo. El modo Clásico funciona exactamente como siempre. Los otros cuatro cambian cómo se puntúa y qué celebra la pantalla grande: las mismas preguntas, una energía completamente distinta en la sala.", "Game modes": "Modos de juego", "Most audience tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to play. Same questions, five completely different rooms — from a calm classroom check-in to a last-one-standing finale people talk about afterwards.": "La mayoría de las herramientas para público ofrecen una sola fórmula: haces una pregunta, miras un gráfico de barras y sigues. PollSlide te pregunta cómo quieres jugar. Las mismas preguntas, cinco salas completamente distintas: desde un repaso tranquilo en clase hasta un final de último superviviente del que todos hablan después.", "⚡ Speed round": "⚡ Ronda rápida", "Speed round": "Ronda rápida", "Streak": "Racha", "Survival": "Supervivencia", "Wager": "Apuesta", "🎯 Classic": "🎯 Clásico", "💀 Survival": "💀 Supervivencia", "🔥 Streak": "🔥 Racha", "🎲 Wager": "🎲 Apuesta"}, "de": {"🎮 Game modes — pick how your quiz plays": "🎮 Spielmodi — wähle, wie dein Quiz läuft", "🎮 Game modes": "🎮 Spielmodi", "When you hit Present, PollSlide asks how you want to run it. Classic works exactly as it always has. The other four change how points are scored and what the big screen celebrates — same questions, completely different energy in the room.": "Wenn du auf Präsentieren klickst, fragt PollSlide, wie du es spielen willst. Klassisch funktioniert genau wie immer. Die anderen vier ändern die Punktevergabe und das, was der große Bildschirm feiert — dieselben Fragen, völlig andere Stimmung im Raum.", "Game modes": "Spielmodi", "Most audience tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to play. Same questions, five completely different rooms — from a calm classroom check-in to a last-one-standing finale people talk about afterwards.": "Die meisten Publikums-Tools bieten nur eine Variante: Frage stellen, Balkendiagramm ansehen, weiter. PollSlide fragt, wie du spielen willst. Dieselben Fragen, fünf völlig verschiedene Räume — vom ruhigen Klassenzimmer-Check bis zum Last-One-Standing-Finale, über das man noch danach spricht.", "⚡ Speed round": "⚡ Schnellrunde", "Speed round": "Schnellrunde", "Streak": "Serie", "Survival": "Survival", "Wager": "Wette", "🎯 Classic": "🎯 Klassisch", "💀 Survival": "💀 Survival", "🔥 Streak": "🔥 Serie", "🎲 Wager": "🎲 Wette"}, "fr": {"🎮 Game modes — pick how your quiz plays": "🎮 Modes de jeu — choisissez comment se joue votre quiz", "🎮 Game modes": "🎮 Modes de jeu", "When you hit Present, PollSlide asks how you want to run it. Classic works exactly as it always has. The other four change how points are scored and what the big screen celebrates — same questions, completely different energy in the room.": "Quand vous lancez Présenter, PollSlide vous demande comment vous voulez jouer. Le mode Classique fonctionne exactement comme avant. Les quatre autres changent le calcul des points et ce que célèbre le grand écran : mêmes questions, énergie totalement différente dans la salle.", "Game modes": "Modes de jeu", "Most audience tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to play. Same questions, five completely different rooms — from a calm classroom check-in to a last-one-standing finale people talk about afterwards.": "La plupart des outils pour public n'offrent qu'une seule formule : poser une question, regarder un graphique, passer à la suite. PollSlide vous demande comment vous voulez jouer. Mêmes questions, cinq salles complètement différentes — du simple point en classe à une finale au dernier survivant dont on reparle ensuite.", "⚡ Speed round": "⚡ Manche rapide", "Speed round": "Manche rapide", "Streak": "Série", "Survival": "Survie", "Wager": "Pari", "🎯 Classic": "🎯 Classique", "💀 Survival": "💀 Survie", "🔥 Streak": "🔥 Série", "🎲 Wager": "🎲 Pari"}, "pt": {"🎮 Game modes — pick how your quiz plays": "🎮 Modos de jogo — escolha como o seu quiz funciona", "🎮 Game modes": "🎮 Modos de jogo", "When you hit Present, PollSlide asks how you want to run it. Classic works exactly as it always has. The other four change how points are scored and what the big screen celebrates — same questions, completely different energy in the room.": "Ao clicar em Apresentar, o PollSlide pergunta como você quer jogar. O modo Clássico funciona exatamente como sempre. Os outros quatro mudam a pontuação e o que a tela grande celebra: as mesmas perguntas, uma energia completamente diferente na sala.", "Game modes": "Modos de jogo", "Most audience tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to play. Same questions, five completely different rooms — from a calm classroom check-in to a last-one-standing finale people talk about afterwards.": "A maioria das ferramentas de público oferece um só formato: faz uma pergunta, olha um gráfico de barras e segue em frente. O PollSlide pergunta como você quer jogar. As mesmas perguntas, cinco salas completamente diferentes — de uma revisão tranquila em aula a uma final de último sobrevivente que todos comentam depois.", "⚡ Speed round": "⚡ Rodada rápida", "Speed round": "Rodada rápida", "Streak": "Sequência", "Survival": "Sobrevivência", "Wager": "Aposta", "🎯 Classic": "🎯 Clássico", "💀 Survival": "💀 Sobrevivência", "🔥 Streak": "🔥 Sequência", "🎲 Wager": "🎲 Aposta"}, "it": {"🎮 Game modes — pick how your quiz plays": "🎮 Modalità di gioco — scegli come si gioca il tuo quiz", "🎮 Game modes": "🎮 Modalità di gioco", "When you hit Present, PollSlide asks how you want to run it. Classic works exactly as it always has. The other four change how points are scored and what the big screen celebrates — same questions, completely different energy in the room.": "Quando premi Presenta, PollSlide ti chiede come vuoi giocare. La modalità Classica funziona esattamente come sempre. Le altre quattro cambiano il punteggio e ciò che il grande schermo celebra: stesse domande, energia completamente diversa nella sala.", "Game modes": "Modalità di gioco", "Most audience tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to play. Same questions, five completely different rooms — from a calm classroom check-in to a last-one-standing finale people talk about afterwards.": "La maggior parte degli strumenti per il pubblico offre un'unica formula: fai una domanda, guardi un grafico a barre, vai avanti. PollSlide ti chiede come vuoi giocare. Stesse domande, cinque sale completamente diverse — da un tranquillo ripasso in aula a un finale all'ultimo sopravvissuto di cui si parla anche dopo.", "⚡ Speed round": "⚡ Round veloce", "Speed round": "Round veloce", "Streak": "Serie", "Survival": "Sopravvivenza", "Wager": "Scommessa", "🎯 Classic": "🎯 Classico", "💀 Survival": "💀 Sopravvivenza", "🔥 Streak": "🔥 Serie", "🎲 Wager": "🎲 Scommessa"}});

