;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es":{"See how it works":"Mira cómo funciona","Free plan runs real quizzes · works with teams · 6 languages on your audience's phones":"El plan gratuito aguanta quizzes de verdad · funciona con equipos · 6 idiomas en los móviles de tu público","Five ways to run the same questions":"Cinco formas de jugar las mismas preguntas","You build your quiz once. When you press Present, you choose how it plays — so the same deck can be a calm classroom check-in on Tuesday and a roaring pub quiz on Friday.":"Creas tu quiz una vez. Al pulsar Presentar eliges cómo se juega, así que la misma baraja puede ser un repaso tranquilo el martes y un concurso de bar a gritos el viernes.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest in the room. The reveal crowns a":"Cuanto más rápido aciertas, más puntúas: hasta el doble para quien antes responda en la sala. La revelación corona a un","Best for: parties, conferences, waking up a flat room":"Ideal para: fiestas, congresos, despertar una sala apagada","FASTEST FINGER":"DEDO MÁS RÁPIDO","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go — and one miss resets it. People start protecting a streak like it's money.":"Los aciertos seguidos suben un multiplicador hasta 3×, con llamas que crecen a medida que avanzas, y un fallo lo reinicia. La gente empieza a proteger su racha como si fuera dinero.","Best for: classrooms, training, anything that rewards consistency":"Ideal para: aulas, formación, cualquier cosa que premie la constancia","Which planet has the shortest day?":"¿Qué planeta tiene el día más corto?","Best for: a grand finale, tie-breakers, high drama":"Ideal para: un gran final, desempates, máxima tensión","You survived":"Has sobrevivido","Stay on this screen — you'll still see every question.":"Quédate en esta pantalla: seguirás viendo todas las preguntas.","🎲 Wager round":"🎲 Ronda de apuesta","Before each question players bet":"Antes de cada pregunta los jugadores apuestan","Best for: comebacks, joker rounds, keeping everyone in the game":"Ideal para: remontadas, rondas comodín, mantener a todos en juego","How confident are you?":"¿Cuánta confianza tienes?","Best for: everything else — and it's still the default":"Ideal para: todo lo demás, y sigue siendo la opción por defecto","✦ LEADERBOARD":"✦ CLASIFICACIÓN","And how much noise it makes is up to you":"Y cuánto ruido hace lo decides tú","Between launching a question and revealing it, there's a wait. A quiz night and a board meeting want opposite things from that wait — so you choose, and it's remembered per deck.":"Entre lanzar una pregunta y revelarla hay una espera. Un concurso nocturno y una reunión de dirección quieren cosas opuestas de esa espera, así que eliges tú, y se recuerda en cada baraja.","No sound, no clock drama — the results simply appear. For board meetings, webinars and anywhere a noise would be rude.":"Sin sonido ni dramatismo de reloj: los resultados simplemente aparecen. Para reuniones, seminarios web y cualquier sitio donde un ruido sería inoportuno.","🎓 Classroom":"🎓 Aula","You hear the room answering as replies land, and the last five seconds fill the screen — but nothing ticks at you. The setting most lessons stay on all term.":"Oyes a la sala respondiendo según llegan las respuestas y los últimos cinco segundos llenan la pantalla, pero nada te marca el tiempo. La opción en la que se quedan casi todas las clases durante el curso.","🎤 Game show":"🎤 Concurso","A clock that ticks faster as it runs out, answers landing audibly, and a held beat before the reveal. For quiz nights, conferences and the final round.":"Un reloj que acelera al agotarse, respuestas que se oyen al llegar y un compás de espera antes de la revelación. Para concursos, congresos y la ronda final.","Built for real pub quizzes, not just classrooms":"Hecho para concursos de bar de verdad, no solo para aulas","Teams, phones, latecomers, and the bit at the end where everyone wants to know who won.":"Equipos, móviles, rezagados y ese momento final en el que todos quieren saber quién ha ganado.","👥 Proper team play":"👥 Juego por equipos de verdad","Each table creates a team and everyone answers on their own phone. A team's score is the":"Cada mesa crea un equipo y cada persona responde en su propio móvil. La puntuación del equipo es la","🎪 Warm-up while they arrive":"🎪 Calentamiento mientras llegan","The big screen runs light trivia before you start, so the room is entertained — and looking at your join code — while stragglers get a drink.":"La pantalla grande pone preguntas ligeras antes de empezar, así la sala se entretiene —y mira tu código de acceso— mientras los rezagados van a por una bebida.","📱 No app to install":"📱 Sin app que instalar","Players scan a QR or type a code at":"Los jugadores escanean un QR o escriben un código en","🎁 A recap to share after":"🎁 Un resumen para compartir después","One click makes a page with the winner, the toughest question and the highlights — send the link to the group chat and they'll come back next week.":"Un clic crea una página con el ganador, la pregunta más difícil y los momentos destacados: manda el enlace al grupo y volverán la semana que viene.","✨ Questions written for you":"✨ Preguntas escritas por ti","Describe the quiz you want and Polly drafts the questions, with the answers marked. Bring your own rounds or let the AI fill the gaps.":"Describe el quiz que quieres y Polly redacta las preguntas, con las respuestas marcadas. Trae tus propias rondas o deja que la IA rellene los huecos.","📊 Runs over your slides":"📊 Funciona sobre tus diapositivas","Present from PollSlide, or float live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF with the free Mac companion.":"Presenta desde PollSlide o superpón los resultados en directo sobre Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF con el companion gratuito para Mac.","Do players need to download anything?":"¿Los jugadores tienen que descargar algo?","No. They scan the QR on your screen or go to":"No. Escanean el QR de tu pantalla o entran en","Can I run it in a noisy pub with bad wifi?":"¿Puedo usarlo en un bar ruidoso con mal wifi?","Players need a data connection, but the pages are small and answers are tiny. Show the join code on screen the whole time so anyone who drops out can rejoin instantly.":"Los jugadores necesitan conexión de datos, pero las páginas son ligeras y las respuestas mínimas. Deja el código de acceso en pantalla todo el rato para que quien se caiga pueda volver a entrar al instante.","Can I mix modes in one night?":"¿Puedo mezclar modos en una misma noche?","Yes — that's the intended way to use it. Start Classic, run a Speed round in the middle, and finish on Survival for the finale. You pick the mode each time you press Present.":"Sí, es justo como está pensado. Empieza en Clásico, mete una Ronda rápida en medio y termina en Supervivencia para el final. Eliges el modo cada vez que pulsas Presentar.","Will it make noise I wasn't expecting?":"¿Va a hacer ruido sin que me lo espere?","No. New decks are set to":"No. Las barajas nuevas están en","How is this different from Kahoot?":"¿En qué se diferencia de Kahoot?","Kahoot is a great game-show quiz. PollSlide does gamified quizzes and study sets":"Kahoot es un gran quiz tipo concurso. PollSlide hace quizzes gamificados y fichas de estudio","side-by-side":"comparativa","What if my questions are in another language?":"¿Y si mis preguntas están en otro idioma?","Your audience picks their language on their own phone and the questions are translated for them, in context — so a mixed room can all play the same quiz.":"Tu público elige su idioma en su propio móvil y las preguntas se le traducen en contexto, así que una sala mixta puede jugar al mismo quiz.","Run your next quiz as a game":"Convierte tu próximo quiz en un juego","Free to start, no card, and your first quiz can be running in about five minutes.":"Empezar es gratis, sin tarjeta, y tu primer quiz puede estar en marcha en unos cinco minutos.","Read the guide":"Leer la guía","Most quiz tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to":"La mayoría de las herramientas de quiz ofrecen un único sabor: haz una pregunta, mira un gráfico de barras y sigue. PollSlide pregunta cómo quieres"},"de":{"See how it works":"So funktioniert es","Free plan runs real quizzes · works with teams · 6 languages on your audience's phones":"Der kostenlose Tarif trägt echte Quiz · funktioniert mit Teams · 6 Sprachen auf den Handys deines Publikums","Five ways to run the same questions":"Fünf Arten, dieselben Fragen zu spielen","You build your quiz once. When you press Present, you choose how it plays — so the same deck can be a calm classroom check-in on Tuesday and a roaring pub quiz on Friday.":"Du baust dein Quiz einmal. Beim Präsentieren wählst du, wie es läuft — dasselbe Deck kann dienstags eine ruhige Lernkontrolle sein und freitags ein lautes Kneipenquiz.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest in the room. The reveal crowns a":"Je schneller du richtig antwortest, desto mehr Punkte — bis zum Doppelten für die Schnellsten im Raum. Die Auflösung krönt einen","Best for: parties, conferences, waking up a flat room":"Am besten für: Partys, Konferenzen, einen müden Raum wecken","FASTEST FINGER":"SCHNELLSTER FINGER","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go — and one miss resets it. People start protecting a streak like it's money.":"Richtige Antworten in Folge steigern einen Multiplikator bis 3×, mit Flammen, die mitwachsen — ein Fehler setzt alles zurück. Leute fangen an, ihre Serie zu hüten wie Geld.","Best for: classrooms, training, anything that rewards consistency":"Am besten für: Unterricht, Schulungen, alles was Beständigkeit belohnt","Which planet has the shortest day?":"Welcher Planet hat den kürzesten Tag?","Best for: a grand finale, tie-breakers, high drama":"Am besten für: ein großes Finale, Stechen, hohe Spannung","You survived":"Du hast überlebt","Stay on this screen — you'll still see every question.":"Bleib auf diesem Bildschirm — du siehst weiterhin jede Frage.","🎲 Wager round":"🎲 Wettrunde","Before each question players bet":"Vor jeder Frage setzen die Spieler","Best for: comebacks, joker rounds, keeping everyone in the game":"Am besten für: Aufholjagden, Joker-Runden, alle im Spiel halten","How confident are you?":"Wie sicher bist du dir?","Best for: everything else — and it's still the default":"Am besten für: alles andere — und weiterhin die Voreinstellung","✦ LEADERBOARD":"✦ RANGLISTE","And how much noise it makes is up to you":"Und wie viel Lärm es macht, entscheidest du","Between launching a question and revealing it, there's a wait. A quiz night and a board meeting want opposite things from that wait — so you choose, and it's remembered per deck.":"Zwischen dem Start einer Frage und der Auflösung liegt eine Wartezeit. Ein Quizabend und eine Vorstandssitzung wollen davon das Gegenteil — also entscheidest du, und es wird je Deck gemerkt.","No sound, no clock drama — the results simply appear. For board meetings, webinars and anywhere a noise would be rude.":"Kein Ton, keine Uhren-Dramatik — die Ergebnisse erscheinen einfach. Für Vorstandssitzungen, Webinare und überall, wo ein Geräusch unhöflich wäre.","🎓 Classroom":"🎓 Unterricht","You hear the room answering as replies land, and the last five seconds fill the screen — but nothing ticks at you. The setting most lessons stay on all term.":"Du hörst den Raum antworten, während die Antworten eintreffen, und die letzten fünf Sekunden füllen den Bildschirm — aber nichts tickt dich an. Die Einstellung, auf der die meisten Stunden das ganze Halbjahr bleiben.","🎤 Game show":"🎤 Quizshow","A clock that ticks faster as it runs out, answers landing audibly, and a held beat before the reveal. For quiz nights, conferences and the final round.":"Eine Uhr, die schneller tickt, je weniger Zeit bleibt, hörbar eintreffende Antworten und ein gehaltener Moment vor der Auflösung. Für Quizabende, Konferenzen und die Schlussrunde.","Built for real pub quizzes, not just classrooms":"Für echte Kneipenquiz gebaut, nicht nur für Klassenzimmer","Teams, phones, latecomers, and the bit at the end where everyone wants to know who won.":"Teams, Handys, Nachzügler und der Moment am Ende, in dem alle wissen wollen, wer gewonnen hat.","👥 Proper team play":"👥 Richtiges Teamspiel","Each table creates a team and everyone answers on their own phone. A team's score is the":"Jeder Tisch bildet ein Team und alle antworten am eigenen Handy. Die Punktzahl eines Teams ist der","🎪 Warm-up while they arrive":"🎪 Aufwärmen, während sie eintrudeln","The big screen runs light trivia before you start, so the room is entertained — and looking at your join code — while stragglers get a drink.":"Die große Leinwand zeigt lockere Fragen vor dem Start, damit der Raum unterhalten ist — und auf deinen Beitrittscode schaut — während die Nachzügler sich etwas zu trinken holen.","📱 No app to install":"📱 Keine App zu installieren","Players scan a QR or type a code at":"Spieler scannen einen QR-Code oder tippen einen Code ein auf","🎁 A recap to share after":"🎁 Ein Rückblick zum Teilen danach","One click makes a page with the winner, the toughest question and the highlights — send the link to the group chat and they'll come back next week.":"Ein Klick erzeugt eine Seite mit dem Sieger, der schwersten Frage und den Höhepunkten — schick den Link in den Gruppenchat und sie kommen nächste Woche wieder.","✨ Questions written for you":"✨ Fragen, die für dich geschrieben werden","Describe the quiz you want and Polly drafts the questions, with the answers marked. Bring your own rounds or let the AI fill the gaps.":"Beschreibe das Quiz, das du willst, und Polly entwirft die Fragen samt markierten Antworten. Bring eigene Runden mit oder lass die KI die Lücken füllen.","📊 Runs over your slides":"📊 Läuft über deinen Folien","Present from PollSlide, or float live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF with the free Mac companion.":"Präsentiere aus PollSlide heraus oder lege Live-Ergebnisse mit dem kostenlosen Mac-Companion über Keynote, PowerPoint oder ein PDF.","Do players need to download anything?":"Müssen Spieler etwas herunterladen?","No. They scan the QR on your screen or go to":"Nein. Sie scannen den QR-Code auf deinem Bildschirm oder gehen auf","Can I run it in a noisy pub with bad wifi?":"Kann ich das in einer lauten Kneipe mit schlechtem WLAN laufen lassen?","Players need a data connection, but the pages are small and answers are tiny. Show the join code on screen the whole time so anyone who drops out can rejoin instantly.":"Spieler brauchen eine Datenverbindung, aber die Seiten sind klein und die Antworten winzig. Lass den Beitrittscode die ganze Zeit sichtbar, damit jeder, der rausfliegt, sofort zurückkommt.","Can I mix modes in one night?":"Kann ich an einem Abend Modi mischen?","Yes — that's the intended way to use it. Start Classic, run a Speed round in the middle, and finish on Survival for the finale. You pick the mode each time you press Present.":"Ja — genau so ist es gedacht. Starte mit Klassisch, schieb in der Mitte eine Schnellrunde ein und beende mit Survival als Finale. Du wählst den Modus jedes Mal beim Präsentieren.","Will it make noise I wasn't expecting?":"Macht es Geräusche, mit denen ich nicht rechne?","No. New decks are set to":"Nein. Neue Decks stehen auf","How is this different from Kahoot?":"Wie unterscheidet sich das von Kahoot?","Kahoot is a great game-show quiz. PollSlide does gamified quizzes and study sets":"Kahoot ist ein großartiges Quizshow-Quiz. PollSlide macht spielerische Quiz und Lernsets","side-by-side":"Gegenüberstellung","What if my questions are in another language?":"Was, wenn meine Fragen in einer anderen Sprache sind?","Your audience picks their language on their own phone and the questions are translated for them, in context — so a mixed room can all play the same quiz.":"Dein Publikum wählt die Sprache am eigenen Handy und die Fragen werden im Kontext übersetzt — so kann ein gemischter Raum dasselbe Quiz spielen.","Run your next quiz as a game":"Mach dein nächstes Quiz zum Spiel","Free to start, no card, and your first quiz can be running in about five minutes.":"Der Einstieg ist kostenlos, ohne Karte, und dein erstes Quiz läuft in etwa fünf Minuten.","Read the guide":"Zur Anleitung","Most quiz tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to":"Die meisten Quiz-Tools bieten eine einzige Variante: Frage stellen, Balkendiagramm ansehen, weiter. PollSlide fragt, wie du"},"fr":{"See how it works":"Voir comment ça marche","Free plan runs real quizzes · works with teams · 6 languages on your audience's phones":"L’offre gratuite fait tourner de vrais quiz · fonctionne en équipes · 6 langues sur les téléphones de votre public","Five ways to run the same questions":"Cinq façons de jouer les mêmes questions","You build your quiz once. When you press Present, you choose how it plays — so the same deck can be a calm classroom check-in on Tuesday and a roaring pub quiz on Friday.":"Vous construisez votre quiz une fois. Au moment de présenter, vous choisissez comment il se joue : le même jeu peut être un point calme en classe le mardi et un quiz de bar déchaîné le vendredi.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest in the room. The reveal crowns a":"Plus vous répondez juste vite, plus vous marquez — jusqu’au double de points pour les plus rapides de la salle. La révélation couronne un","Best for: parties, conferences, waking up a flat room":"Idéal pour : fêtes, conférences, réveiller une salle éteinte","FASTEST FINGER":"DOIGT LE PLUS RAPIDE","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go — and one miss resets it. People start protecting a streak like it's money.":"Les bonnes réponses d’affilée font monter un multiplicateur jusqu’à 3×, avec des flammes qui grandissent — et une erreur remet tout à zéro. Les gens se mettent à protéger leur série comme de l’argent.","Best for: classrooms, training, anything that rewards consistency":"Idéal pour : cours, formations, tout ce qui récompense la régularité","Which planet has the shortest day?":"Quelle planète a le jour le plus court ?","Best for: a grand finale, tie-breakers, high drama":"Idéal pour : une grande finale, des départages, beaucoup de tension","You survived":"Vous avez survécu","Stay on this screen — you'll still see every question.":"Restez sur cet écran — vous verrez quand même chaque question.","🎲 Wager round":"🎲 Manche de mise","Before each question players bet":"Avant chaque question, les joueurs misent","Best for: comebacks, joker rounds, keeping everyone in the game":"Idéal pour : remontées, manches joker, garder tout le monde dans la partie","How confident are you?":"À quel point êtes-vous sûr ?","Best for: everything else — and it's still the default":"Idéal pour : tout le reste — et c’est toujours l’option par défaut","✦ LEADERBOARD":"✦ CLASSEMENT","And how much noise it makes is up to you":"Et le bruit que ça fait, c’est vous qui décidez","Between launching a question and revealing it, there's a wait. A quiz night and a board meeting want opposite things from that wait — so you choose, and it's remembered per deck.":"Entre le lancement d’une question et sa révélation, il y a une attente. Une soirée quiz et un conseil d’administration en attendent l’inverse : c’est donc vous qui choisissez, et le choix est retenu par jeu.","No sound, no clock drama — the results simply appear. For board meetings, webinars and anywhere a noise would be rude.":"Aucun son, aucun suspense d’horloge — les résultats apparaissent, simplement. Pour les réunions, les webinaires et partout où un bruit serait déplacé.","🎓 Classroom":"🎓 Classe","You hear the room answering as replies land, and the last five seconds fill the screen — but nothing ticks at you. The setting most lessons stay on all term.":"Vous entendez la salle répondre à mesure que les réponses arrivent, et les cinq dernières secondes remplissent l’écran — mais rien ne vous égrène le temps. Le réglage sur lequel la plupart des cours restent tout le trimestre.","🎤 Game show":"🎤 Jeu télévisé","A clock that ticks faster as it runs out, answers landing audibly, and a held beat before the reveal. For quiz nights, conferences and the final round.":"Une horloge qui s’accélère à mesure que le temps file, des réponses qu’on entend arriver et un temps suspendu avant la révélation. Pour les soirées quiz, les conférences et la manche finale.","Built for real pub quizzes, not just classrooms":"Conçu pour de vrais quiz de bar, pas seulement pour les salles de classe","Teams, phones, latecomers, and the bit at the end where everyone wants to know who won.":"Les équipes, les téléphones, les retardataires, et le moment final où tout le monde veut savoir qui a gagné.","👥 Proper team play":"👥 Un vrai jeu en équipes","Each table creates a team and everyone answers on their own phone. A team's score is the":"Chaque table crée une équipe et chacun répond sur son propre téléphone. Le score d’une équipe est la","🎪 Warm-up while they arrive":"🎪 Échauffement pendant qu’ils arrivent","The big screen runs light trivia before you start, so the room is entertained — and looking at your join code — while stragglers get a drink.":"Le grand écran propose des questions légères avant de commencer : la salle est occupée — et regarde votre code d’accès — pendant que les retardataires vont chercher un verre.","📱 No app to install":"📱 Aucune application à installer","Players scan a QR or type a code at":"Les joueurs scannent un QR ou saisissent un code sur","🎁 A recap to share after":"🎁 Un récapitulatif à partager après","One click makes a page with the winner, the toughest question and the highlights — send the link to the group chat and they'll come back next week.":"Un clic crée une page avec le gagnant, la question la plus difficile et les temps forts — envoyez le lien dans le groupe et ils reviendront la semaine suivante.","✨ Questions written for you":"✨ Des questions rédigées pour vous","Describe the quiz you want and Polly drafts the questions, with the answers marked. Bring your own rounds or let the AI fill the gaps.":"Décrivez le quiz que vous voulez et Polly rédige les questions, avec les bonnes réponses marquées. Apportez vos propres manches ou laissez l’IA combler les trous.","📊 Runs over your slides":"📊 Fonctionne par-dessus vos diapositives","Present from PollSlide, or float live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF with the free Mac companion.":"Présentez depuis PollSlide, ou superposez les résultats en direct à Keynote, PowerPoint ou un PDF avec le companion Mac gratuit.","Do players need to download anything?":"Les joueurs doivent-ils télécharger quelque chose ?","No. They scan the QR on your screen or go to":"Non. Ils scannent le QR à l’écran ou vont sur","Can I run it in a noisy pub with bad wifi?":"Puis-je l’utiliser dans un bar bruyant avec un mauvais wifi ?","Players need a data connection, but the pages are small and answers are tiny. Show the join code on screen the whole time so anyone who drops out can rejoin instantly.":"Les joueurs ont besoin d’une connexion data, mais les pages sont légères et les réponses minuscules. Laissez le code d’accès à l’écran en permanence pour que ceux qui décrochent puissent revenir aussitôt.","Can I mix modes in one night?":"Puis-je mélanger les modes en une soirée ?","Yes — that's the intended way to use it. Start Classic, run a Speed round in the middle, and finish on Survival for the finale. You pick the mode each time you press Present.":"Oui — c’est même l’usage prévu. Commencez en Classique, glissez une Manche rapide au milieu et terminez en Survie pour la finale. Vous choisissez le mode à chaque fois que vous présentez.","Will it make noise I wasn't expecting?":"Va-t-il faire du bruit sans prévenir ?","No. New decks are set to":"Non. Les nouveaux jeux sont réglés sur","How is this different from Kahoot?":"En quoi est-ce différent de Kahoot ?","Kahoot is a great game-show quiz. PollSlide does gamified quizzes and study sets":"Kahoot est un excellent quiz façon jeu télévisé. PollSlide fait des quiz ludiques et des fiches de révision","side-by-side":"comparatif","What if my questions are in another language?":"Et si mes questions sont dans une autre langue ?","Your audience picks their language on their own phone and the questions are translated for them, in context — so a mixed room can all play the same quiz.":"Votre public choisit sa langue sur son propre téléphone et les questions lui sont traduites, en contexte — une salle mixte peut donc jouer au même quiz.","Run your next quiz as a game":"Faites de votre prochain quiz un jeu","Free to start, no card, and your first quiz can be running in about five minutes.":"Débuter est gratuit, sans carte, et votre premier quiz peut tourner en cinq minutes environ.","Read the guide":"Lire le guide","Most quiz tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to":"La plupart des outils de quiz n’offrent qu’une seule saveur : poser une question, regarder un graphique, passer. PollSlide vous demande comment vous voulez"},"pt":{"See how it works":"Veja como funciona","Free plan runs real quizzes · works with teams · 6 languages on your audience's phones":"O plano gratuito aguenta quizzes a sério · funciona com equipas · 6 idiomas nos telemóveis do seu público","Five ways to run the same questions":"Cinco formas de jogar as mesmas perguntas","You build your quiz once. When you press Present, you choose how it plays — so the same deck can be a calm classroom check-in on Tuesday and a roaring pub quiz on Friday.":"Constrói o seu quiz uma vez. Ao carregar em Apresentar escolhe como se joga — o mesmo baralho pode ser uma revisão calma na terça e um quiz de bar aos gritos na sexta.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest in the room. The reveal crowns a":"Quanto mais depressa acertar, mais pontua — até ao dobro para os mais rápidos da sala. A revelação coroa um","Best for: parties, conferences, waking up a flat room":"Ideal para: festas, conferências, acordar uma sala apática","FASTEST FINGER":"DEDO MAIS RÁPIDO","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go — and one miss resets it. People start protecting a streak like it's money.":"Os acertos seguidos aumentam um multiplicador até 3×, com chamas que crescem — e um erro reinicia tudo. As pessoas começam a proteger a sequência como se fosse dinheiro.","Best for: classrooms, training, anything that rewards consistency":"Ideal para: aulas, formação, tudo o que premeia a consistência","Which planet has the shortest day?":"Que planeta tem o dia mais curto?","Best for: a grand finale, tie-breakers, high drama":"Ideal para: um grande final, desempates, muita tensão","You survived":"Sobreviveu","Stay on this screen — you'll still see every question.":"Fique neste ecrã — continuará a ver todas as perguntas.","🎲 Wager round":"🎲 Ronda de aposta","Before each question players bet":"Antes de cada pergunta os jogadores apostam","Best for: comebacks, joker rounds, keeping everyone in the game":"Ideal para: reviravoltas, rondas joker, manter todos no jogo","How confident are you?":"Que confiança tem?","Best for: everything else — and it's still the default":"Ideal para: tudo o resto — e continua a ser a predefinição","✦ LEADERBOARD":"✦ CLASSIFICAÇÃO","And how much noise it makes is up to you":"E quanto barulho faz é consigo","Between launching a question and revealing it, there's a wait. A quiz night and a board meeting want opposite things from that wait — so you choose, and it's remembered per deck.":"Entre lançar uma pergunta e revelá-la há uma espera. Uma noite de quiz e uma reunião de direção querem coisas opostas dessa espera — por isso escolhe você, e fica guardado em cada baralho.","No sound, no clock drama — the results simply appear. For board meetings, webinars and anywhere a noise would be rude.":"Sem som nem drama de relógio — os resultados simplesmente aparecem. Para reuniões, webinars e onde um ruído seria indelicado.","🎓 Classroom":"🎓 Sala de aula","You hear the room answering as replies land, and the last five seconds fill the screen — but nothing ticks at you. The setting most lessons stay on all term.":"Ouve a sala a responder à medida que as respostas chegam e os últimos cinco segundos enchem o ecrã — mas nada lhe marca o tempo. A definição em que a maioria das aulas fica todo o período.","🎤 Game show":"🎤 Concurso","A clock that ticks faster as it runs out, answers landing audibly, and a held beat before the reveal. For quiz nights, conferences and the final round.":"Um relógio que acelera à medida que o tempo acaba, respostas que se ouvem a chegar e um compasso de espera antes da revelação. Para noites de quiz, conferências e a ronda final.","Built for real pub quizzes, not just classrooms":"Feito para quizzes de bar a sério, não só para salas de aula","Teams, phones, latecomers, and the bit at the end where everyone wants to know who won.":"Equipas, telemóveis, atrasados e aquele momento final em que todos querem saber quem ganhou.","👥 Proper team play":"👥 Jogo por equipas a sério","Each table creates a team and everyone answers on their own phone. A team's score is the":"Cada mesa cria uma equipa e cada um responde no seu telemóvel. A pontuação da equipa é a","🎪 Warm-up while they arrive":"🎪 Aquecimento enquanto chegam","The big screen runs light trivia before you start, so the room is entertained — and looking at your join code — while stragglers get a drink.":"O ecrã grande passa perguntas leves antes de começar, para a sala se entreter — e olhar para o seu código de entrada — enquanto os atrasados vão buscar uma bebida.","📱 No app to install":"📱 Sem app para instalar","Players scan a QR or type a code at":"Os jogadores leem um QR ou escrevem um código em","🎁 A recap to share after":"🎁 Um resumo para partilhar depois","One click makes a page with the winner, the toughest question and the highlights — send the link to the group chat and they'll come back next week.":"Um clique cria uma página com o vencedor, a pergunta mais difícil e os melhores momentos — envie o link para o grupo e voltam na semana seguinte.","✨ Questions written for you":"✨ Perguntas escritas por si","Describe the quiz you want and Polly drafts the questions, with the answers marked. Bring your own rounds or let the AI fill the gaps.":"Descreva o quiz que quer e a Polly redige as perguntas, com as respostas marcadas. Traga as suas próprias rondas ou deixe a IA preencher as lacunas.","📊 Runs over your slides":"📊 Funciona sobre os seus diapositivos","Present from PollSlide, or float live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF with the free Mac companion.":"Apresente a partir do PollSlide ou sobreponha os resultados em direto a Keynote, PowerPoint ou um PDF com o companion gratuito para Mac.","Do players need to download anything?":"Os jogadores precisam de descarregar alguma coisa?","No. They scan the QR on your screen or go to":"Não. Leem o QR do seu ecrã ou vão a","Can I run it in a noisy pub with bad wifi?":"Posso usá-lo num bar barulhento com mau wifi?","Players need a data connection, but the pages are small and answers are tiny. Show the join code on screen the whole time so anyone who drops out can rejoin instantly.":"Os jogadores precisam de ligação de dados, mas as páginas são pequenas e as respostas mínimas. Deixe o código de entrada no ecrã o tempo todo para que quem caia possa voltar de imediato.","Can I mix modes in one night?":"Posso misturar modos numa só noite?","Yes — that's the intended way to use it. Start Classic, run a Speed round in the middle, and finish on Survival for the finale. You pick the mode each time you press Present.":"Sim — é mesmo assim que se usa. Comece em Clássico, meta uma Ronda rápida a meio e acabe em Sobrevivência para o final. Escolhe o modo sempre que carrega em Apresentar.","Will it make noise I wasn't expecting?":"Vai fazer barulho sem eu estar à espera?","No. New decks are set to":"Não. Os baralhos novos estão em","How is this different from Kahoot?":"Em que é que isto é diferente do Kahoot?","Kahoot is a great game-show quiz. PollSlide does gamified quizzes and study sets":"O Kahoot é um ótimo quiz estilo concurso. O PollSlide faz quizzes gamificados e conjuntos de estudo","side-by-side":"comparação","What if my questions are in another language?":"E se as minhas perguntas estiverem noutro idioma?","Your audience picks their language on their own phone and the questions are translated for them, in context — so a mixed room can all play the same quiz.":"O seu público escolhe o idioma no próprio telemóvel e as perguntas são traduzidas em contexto — por isso uma sala mista pode jogar o mesmo quiz.","Run your next quiz as a game":"Torne o seu próximo quiz num jogo","Free to start, no card, and your first quiz can be running in about five minutes.":"Começar é grátis, sem cartão, e o seu primeiro quiz pode estar a correr em cerca de cinco minutos.","Read the guide":"Ler o guia","Most quiz tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to":"A maioria das ferramentas de quiz dá um único sabor: fazer uma pergunta, ver um gráfico de barras, seguir. O PollSlide pergunta como quer"},"it":{"See how it works":"Guarda come funziona","Free plan runs real quizzes · works with teams · 6 languages on your audience's phones":"Il piano gratuito regge quiz veri · funziona con le squadre · 6 lingue sui telefoni del pubblico","Five ways to run the same questions":"Cinque modi di giocare le stesse domande","You build your quiz once. When you press Present, you choose how it plays — so the same deck can be a calm classroom check-in on Tuesday and a roaring pub quiz on Friday.":"Costruisci il quiz una volta sola. Quando premi Presenta scegli come si gioca: lo stesso mazzo può essere un ripasso tranquillo il martedì e un quiz da pub scatenato il venerdì.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest in the room. The reveal crowns a":"Più rispondi in fretta e correttamente, più punti fai — fino al doppio per i più rapidi della sala. La rivelazione incorona un","Best for: parties, conferences, waking up a flat room":"Ideale per: feste, conferenze, svegliare una sala spenta","FASTEST FINGER":"DITO PIÙ VELOCE","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go — and one miss resets it. People start protecting a streak like it's money.":"Le risposte esatte di fila aumentano un moltiplicatore fino a 3×, con fiamme che crescono — e un errore azzera tutto. La gente inizia a proteggere la serie come fossero soldi.","Best for: classrooms, training, anything that rewards consistency":"Ideale per: aule, formazione, tutto ciò che premia la costanza","Which planet has the shortest day?":"Quale pianeta ha il giorno più corto?","Best for: a grand finale, tie-breakers, high drama":"Ideale per: un gran finale, spareggi, massima tensione","You survived":"Sei sopravvissuto","Stay on this screen — you'll still see every question.":"Resta su questa schermata: continuerai a vedere ogni domanda.","🎲 Wager round":"🎲 Round di scommessa","Before each question players bet":"Prima di ogni domanda i giocatori puntano","Best for: comebacks, joker rounds, keeping everyone in the game":"Ideale per: rimonte, round jolly, tenere tutti in gioco","How confident are you?":"Quanto sei sicuro?","Best for: everything else — and it's still the default":"Ideale per: tutto il resto — ed è ancora l’impostazione predefinita","✦ LEADERBOARD":"✦ CLASSIFICA","And how much noise it makes is up to you":"E quanto rumore fa lo decidi tu","Between launching a question and revealing it, there's a wait. A quiz night and a board meeting want opposite things from that wait — so you choose, and it's remembered per deck.":"Tra il lancio di una domanda e la rivelazione c’è un’attesa. Una serata quiz e un consiglio di amministrazione vogliono l’opposto: quindi scegli tu, e la scelta viene ricordata per ogni mazzo.","No sound, no clock drama — the results simply appear. For board meetings, webinars and anywhere a noise would be rude.":"Nessun suono, nessun dramma da orologio — i risultati compaiono e basta. Per riunioni, webinar e ovunque un rumore sarebbe fuori luogo.","🎓 Classroom":"🎓 Aula","You hear the room answering as replies land, and the last five seconds fill the screen — but nothing ticks at you. The setting most lessons stay on all term.":"Senti la sala rispondere mentre arrivano le risposte e gli ultimi cinque secondi riempiono lo schermo — ma nulla ti scandisce il tempo. L’impostazione su cui restano quasi tutte le lezioni per tutto il quadrimestre.","🎤 Game show":"🎤 Quiz show","A clock that ticks faster as it runs out, answers landing audibly, and a held beat before the reveal. For quiz nights, conferences and the final round.":"Un orologio che accelera mentre il tempo scade, risposte che si sentono arrivare e una pausa sospesa prima della rivelazione. Per serate quiz, conferenze e il round finale.","Built for real pub quizzes, not just classrooms":"Fatto per veri quiz da pub, non solo per le aule","Teams, phones, latecomers, and the bit at the end where everyone wants to know who won.":"Squadre, telefoni, ritardatari e quel momento finale in cui tutti vogliono sapere chi ha vinto.","👥 Proper team play":"👥 Vero gioco a squadre","Each table creates a team and everyone answers on their own phone. A team's score is the":"Ogni tavolo crea una squadra e ognuno risponde dal proprio telefono. Il punteggio di una squadra è la","🎪 Warm-up while they arrive":"🎪 Riscaldamento mentre arrivano","The big screen runs light trivia before you start, so the room is entertained — and looking at your join code — while stragglers get a drink.":"Il grande schermo propone domande leggere prima di iniziare, così la sala si diverte — e guarda il tuo codice d’accesso — mentre i ritardatari prendono da bere.","📱 No app to install":"📱 Nessuna app da installare","Players scan a QR or type a code at":"I giocatori scansionano un QR o digitano un codice su","🎁 A recap to share after":"🎁 Un riepilogo da condividere dopo","One click makes a page with the winner, the toughest question and the highlights — send the link to the group chat and they'll come back next week.":"Un clic crea una pagina con il vincitore, la domanda più difficile e i momenti migliori — manda il link nel gruppo e torneranno la settimana dopo.","✨ Questions written for you":"✨ Domande scritte per te","Describe the quiz you want and Polly drafts the questions, with the answers marked. Bring your own rounds or let the AI fill the gaps.":"Descrivi il quiz che vuoi e Polly scrive le domande, con le risposte segnate. Porta i tuoi round o lascia che l’IA riempia i vuoti.","📊 Runs over your slides":"📊 Funziona sopra le tue slide","Present from PollSlide, or float live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF with the free Mac companion.":"Presenta da PollSlide, o sovrapponi i risultati dal vivo a Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF con il companion gratuito per Mac.","Do players need to download anything?":"I giocatori devono scaricare qualcosa?","No. They scan the QR on your screen or go to":"No. Scansionano il QR sul tuo schermo oppure vanno su","Can I run it in a noisy pub with bad wifi?":"Posso usarlo in un pub rumoroso con wifi scadente?","Players need a data connection, but the pages are small and answers are tiny. Show the join code on screen the whole time so anyone who drops out can rejoin instantly.":"I giocatori hanno bisogno di una connessione dati, ma le pagine sono leggere e le risposte piccolissime. Tieni il codice d’accesso sempre sullo schermo così chi si disconnette rientra subito.","Can I mix modes in one night?":"Posso mischiare le modalità in una sola serata?","Yes — that's the intended way to use it. Start Classic, run a Speed round in the middle, and finish on Survival for the finale. You pick the mode each time you press Present.":"Sì — è proprio l’uso previsto. Inizia in Classica, infila un Round veloce a metà e chiudi con Sopravvivenza per il finale. Scegli la modalità ogni volta che premi Presenta.","Will it make noise I wasn't expecting?":"Farà rumore senza che me lo aspetti?","No. New decks are set to":"No. I mazzi nuovi sono impostati su","How is this different from Kahoot?":"In cosa è diverso da Kahoot?","Kahoot is a great game-show quiz. PollSlide does gamified quizzes and study sets":"Kahoot è un ottimo quiz in stile quiz show. PollSlide fa quiz gamificati e set di studio","side-by-side":"confronto","What if my questions are in another language?":"E se le mie domande sono in un’altra lingua?","Your audience picks their language on their own phone and the questions are translated for them, in context — so a mixed room can all play the same quiz.":"Il tuo pubblico sceglie la lingua sul proprio telefono e le domande vengono tradotte nel contesto — così una sala mista può giocare lo stesso quiz.","Run your next quiz as a game":"Trasforma il tuo prossimo quiz in un gioco","Free to start, no card, and your first quiz can be running in about five minutes.":"Iniziare è gratis, senza carta, e il tuo primo quiz può girare in circa cinque minuti.","Read the guide":"Leggi la guida","Most quiz tools give you one flavour: ask a question, watch a bar chart, move on. PollSlide asks how you want to":"La maggior parte degli strumenti per quiz offre un solo sapore: fai una domanda, guardi un grafico a barre, avanti. PollSlide ti chiede come vuoi"}});

