;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es":{"&larr; Back to pollslide.com":"&larr; Volver a pollslide.com","For teachers":"Para docentes","📈 Progress over time":"📈 Progreso a lo largo del tiempo","📶 Answers survive bad wifi":"📶 Las respuestas sobreviven al mal wifi","🎞 GIFs, without the hunting":"🎞 GIFs, sin tener que buscarlos","🎤 Atmosphere — how the wait feels":"🎤 Atmósfera: cómo se siente la espera","👥 Class lists":"👥 Listas de clase","🔐 Making sure it's really them":"🔐 Asegurarte de que son quienes dicen ser","🔁 Second attempts":"🔁 Segundos intentos","🎓 Gradebook export":"🎓 Exportar el cuaderno de notas","👁 Know if someone leaves the screen":"👁 Saber si alguien sale de la pantalla","Each question has a QR code. Drop it on your Keynote, PowerPoint, or a PDF.":"Cada pregunta tiene su código QR. Ponlo en tu Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF.","📱 No phone to scan the QR? No problem.":"📱 ¿Sin móvil para escanear el QR? No pasa nada.","Anyone on a laptop (or any browser) can join without scanning: they go to":"Quien esté en un portátil (o en cualquier navegador) puede entrar sin escanear: va a","So your audience always has both options, add this line":"Para que tu público siempre tenga las dos opciones, añade esta línea","In the app, the Share / QR window has a":"En la app, la ventana de Compartir / QR tiene un","On a study set, click":"En un conjunto de estudio, haz clic en","Got a quiz or poll instead? Click":"¿Tienes un quiz o una encuesta? Haz clic en","You land on your":"Aterrizas en tu","Pick how you want to study today — then just keep coming back. The scheduler decides what you see next.":"Elige cómo quieres estudiar hoy y luego simplemente vuelve. El planificador decide qué ves después.","Flip cards and rate yourself Again / Hard / Good / Easy. Proper spaced repetition schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it.":"Da la vuelta a las tarjetas y puntúate: Otra vez / Difícil / Bien / Fácil. La repetición espaciada de verdad programa cada tarjeta justo para cuando estás a punto de olvidarla.","Sixty seconds, as many cards as you can get right, and a personal best to beat. Perfect when you've only got two minutes.":"Sesenta segundos, todas las tarjetas que puedas acertar y un récord personal que batir. Perfecto cuando solo tienes dos minutos.","Ten rungs of rising stakes with two lifelines and safe havens — bank your progress or risk it for the top. Game-show tension, real revision.":"Diez peldaños de riesgo creciente con dos comodines y puntos seguros: guarda lo avanzado o arriésgalo por llegar arriba. Tensión de concurso, repaso de verdad.","Choose squares from a board. The high-value squares are quietly the cards you know least well, so the game steers you at your weak spots.":"Elige casillas de un tablero. Las casillas de más valor son, sin decirlo, las tarjetas que peor te sabes, así que el juego te lleva a tus puntos débiles.","Study anything, any set, and your streak grows. Miss a day and it resets — which is exactly why it works.":"Estudia lo que sea, de cualquier conjunto, y tu racha crece. Salta un día y se reinicia, que es justo por lo que funciona.","Every card moves Learning → Familiar → Mastered as it survives longer gaps. Watching the bar go green is the point.":"Cada tarjeta avanza de Aprendiendo → Familiar → Dominada según sobrevive a intervalos más largos. Ver la barra ponerse verde es justo la gracia.","Your study home":"Tu espacio de estudio","Build your questions as normal, then click":"Crea tus preguntas como siempre y luego haz clic en","Pick a mode in the":"Elige un modo en el","Everyone's phone shows what's at stake, and the big screen calls out the drama as each answer is revealed.":"El móvil de cada persona muestra lo que está en juego, y la pantalla grande narra la tensión conforme se revela cada respuesta.","You can switch modes between rounds — start Classic, finish on Survival for a grand finale.":"Puedes cambiar de modo entre rondas: empieza en Clásico y termina en Supervivencia para un gran final.","One point per correct answer, you reveal when you're ready. Exactly how PollSlide has always worked — nothing changes.":"Un punto por respuesta correcta y revelas cuando quieras. Exactamente como PollSlide ha funcionado siempre: no cambia nada.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest. The reveal crowns a":"Cuanto más rápido aciertas, más puntúas: hasta el doble para quien antes responda. La revelación corona a un","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go. One miss resets it.":"Los aciertos seguidos suben un multiplicador hasta 3×, con llamas que crecen a medida que avanzas. Un fallo lo reinicia.","One wrong answer and you're out. Knocked-out players keep watching, and the screen counts down who's still standing.":"Una respuesta incorrecta y quedas fuera. Quien cae sigue mirando, y la pantalla va contando quién queda en pie.","Before each question players bet Safe (1×), Risky (2×) or Bold (3×). Get it wrong and it costs you.":"Antes de cada pregunta se apuesta Seguro (1×), Arriesgado (2×) o Audaz (3×). Si fallas, te cuesta.","📈 Everyone can see they're moving":"📈 Todo el mundo ve que se mueve","Whatever the mode, the leaderboard shows ▲ and ▼ arrows as people climb and slip — so the room feels the race, not just the scores.":"Sea cual sea el modo, la clasificación muestra flechas ▲ y ▼ cuando alguien sube o baja, así la sala siente la carrera y no solo los puntos.","Open the presentation you want to run and click":"Abre la presentación que quieras usar y haz clic en","Present as normal. After people type their name, they see a":"Presenta con normalidad. Después de escribir su nombre, cada persona ve una","The first person at a table taps":"La primera persona de cada mesa toca","Anyone who'd rather play alone taps":"Quien prefiera jugar en solitario toca","Your leaderboards, podium and Final Results now show":"Tus clasificaciones, el podio y los Resultados finales ahora muestran","⚖️ Big teams don't win by default":"⚖️ Los equipos grandes no ganan por defecto","A team's score is the":"La puntuación de un equipo es la","📱 One phone each":"📱 Un móvil por persona","Everyone answers on their own phone — no passing a single device around, and everyone gets the questions in their own language if they need to.":"Cada persona responde en su propio móvil: nada de pasarse un aparato, y quien lo necesite recibe las preguntas en su idioma.","🔀 Latecomers are fine":"🔀 Los rezagados no son problema","Turn team play on at any point. Anyone already in gets the team screen next time they answer, and people can join a team late.":"Activa el juego por equipos cuando quieras. Quien ya esté dentro verá la pantalla de equipos la próxima vez que responda, y se puede entrar en un equipo más tarde.","💀 Survival — the big screen":"💀 Supervivencia: la pantalla grande","players drop out until one is left standing":"los jugadores van cayendo hasta que queda uno en pie","Warm-up trivia appears automatically underneath the join banner while you're waiting.":"Las preguntas de calentamiento aparecen solas bajo el cartel de acceso mientras esperas.","Questions rotate on their own — each shows for a few seconds, reveals its answer, then moves on.":"Las preguntas van rotando solas: cada una se muestra unos segundos, revela su respuesta y pasa a la siguiente.","It disappears the instant you launch your first real question.":"Desaparece en cuanto lanzas tu primera pregunta de verdad.","Don't want it? Click":"¿No lo quieres? Haz clic en","🚫 No spoilers":"🚫 Sin destripes","Warm-up questions come from a built-in general-knowledge set — never from your deck — so nothing in your actual quiz is given away.":"Las preguntas de calentamiento salen de un conjunto de cultura general incorporado, nunca de tu baraja, así que no se destripa nada de tu quiz real.","👀 Keeps the code on screen":"👀 Mantiene el código en pantalla","The join link, code and QR stay visible above the trivia, so latecomers can still get in while everyone else plays along.":"El enlace, el código y el QR siguen visibles encima de las preguntas, así los rezagados pueden entrar mientras el resto juega.","⚡ Zero setup":"⚡ Cero configuración","Nothing to configure and no AI needed — it works even if your internet or AI service is having a bad day.":"Nada que configurar y sin necesidad de IA: funciona aunque tu internet o el servicio de IA estén teniendo un mal día.","Launch a question and let a few answers come in (you need at least":"Lanza una pregunta y deja que lleguen algunas respuestas (necesitas al menos","Polly reads the actual responses and offers":"Polly lee las respuestas reales y propone","Not useful? Close it. Nothing is added or launched unless you choose it.":"¿No te sirve? Ciérralo. No se añade ni se lanza nada salvo que tú lo elijas.","🧭 You're always in control":"🧭 El control siempre es tuyo","Polly never launches anything by itself. Every suggestion is a proposal you accept, edit later, or ignore.":"Polly nunca lanza nada por su cuenta. Cada sugerencia es una propuesta que aceptas, editas después o ignoras.","Like AI Insights, this runs on PollSlide's own AI first rather than a third-party cloud, and it's included in your plan — not charged per use.":"Igual que Análisis IA, esto funciona primero en la IA propia de PollSlide y no en una nube de terceros, y está incluido en tu plan: no se cobra por uso.","🛟 Never blocks your session":"🛟 Nunca bloquea tu sesión","If the AI can't be reached, you get a calm \"unavailable right now\" message. Your questions, results and reveal all carry on exactly as normal.":"Si no se puede llegar a la IA, verás un aviso tranquilo de «no disponible ahora mismo». Tus preguntas, resultados y revelación siguen exactamente igual.","In the filters, choose the":"En los filtros, elige el","You get a link —":"Obtienes un enlace:","Anyone with the link can open it. No sign-in, no app, works on any phone.":"Cualquiera con el enlace puede abrirlo. Sin iniciar sesión, sin app, funciona en cualquier móvil.","🏆 The bits people care about":"🏆 Lo que de verdad le importa a la gente","Winner (or winning team), leaderboard, how many took part, the toughest question, and a question-by-question breakdown.":"Ganador (o equipo ganador), clasificación, cuánta gente participó, la pregunta más difícil y un desglose pregunta a pregunta.","✨ With a summary when it fits":"✨ Con un resumen cuando encaja","If your session had written answers, Polly adds a one-line \"in a nutshell\" summary. If the AI isn't available, the recap still publishes with every stat intact.":"Si tu sesión tuvo respuestas escritas, Polly añade un resumen de una línea. Si la IA no está disponible, el resumen se publica igual con todas las estadísticas intactas.","🔗 Link-only, and yours to delete":"🔗 Solo por enlace, y tuyo para borrarlo","The page is only reachable by its unguessable link — it isn't listed or searchable. It shows the display names people chose during the session.":"La página solo es accesible por su enlace imposible de adivinar: no está listada ni se puede buscar. Muestra los nombres que la gente eligió durante la sesión.","In the left panel, the":"En el panel izquierdo, el","To file something, open a deck's":"Para archivar algo, abre el","Anything you create while inside a folder is filed there automatically.":"Todo lo que crees estando dentro de una carpeta se archiva ahí automáticamente."},"de":{"&larr; Back to pollslide.com":"&larr; Zurück zu pollslide.com","For teachers":"Für Lehrkräfte","📈 Progress over time":"📈 Fortschritt über die Zeit","📶 Answers survive bad wifi":"📶 Antworten überstehen schlechtes WLAN","🎞 GIFs, without the hunting":"🎞 GIFs, ohne die Sucherei","🎤 Atmosphere — how the wait feels":"🎤 Atmosphäre — wie sich das Warten anfühlt","👥 Class lists":"👥 Klassenlisten","🔐 Making sure it's really them":"🔐 Sicherstellen, dass sie es wirklich sind","🔁 Second attempts":"🔁 Zweite Versuche","🎓 Gradebook export":"🎓 Notenbuch exportieren","👁 Know if someone leaves the screen":"👁 Merken, wenn jemand den Bildschirm verlässt","Each question has a QR code. Drop it on your Keynote, PowerPoint, or a PDF.":"Jede Frage hat einen QR-Code. Setz ihn in dein Keynote, PowerPoint oder ein PDF.","📱 No phone to scan the QR? No problem.":"📱 Kein Handy zum Scannen? Kein Problem.","Anyone on a laptop (or any browser) can join without scanning: they go to":"Wer an einem Laptop sitzt (oder irgendeinem Browser), kommt ohne Scannen rein: einfach auf","So your audience always has both options, add this line":"Damit dein Publikum immer beide Wege hat, füg diese Zeile hinzu","In the app, the Share / QR window has a":"In der App hat das Teilen-/QR-Fenster einen","On a study set, click":"Klick bei einem Lernset auf","Got a quiz or poll instead? Click":"Stattdessen ein Quiz oder eine Umfrage? Klick auf","You land on your":"Du landest auf deiner","Pick how you want to study today — then just keep coming back. The scheduler decides what you see next.":"Wähl, wie du heute lernen willst — und komm einfach wieder. Der Planer entscheidet, was als Nächstes drankommt.","Flip cards and rate yourself Again / Hard / Good / Easy. Proper spaced repetition schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it.":"Dreh die Karten um und bewerte dich selbst: Nochmal / Schwer / Gut / Leicht. Echte Spaced Repetition legt jede Karte auf den Moment, in dem du sie fast vergessen hast.","Sixty seconds, as many cards as you can get right, and a personal best to beat. Perfect when you've only got two minutes.":"Sechzig Sekunden, so viele Karten wie möglich richtig, und eine Bestleistung zum Schlagen. Perfekt, wenn du nur zwei Minuten hast.","Ten rungs of rising stakes with two lifelines and safe havens — bank your progress or risk it for the top. Game-show tension, real revision.":"Zehn Stufen mit steigendem Einsatz, zwei Jokern und sicheren Stufen — sichere deinen Fortschritt oder riskier ihn für ganz oben. Quizshow-Spannung, echtes Lernen.","Choose squares from a board. The high-value squares are quietly the cards you know least well, so the game steers you at your weak spots.":"Wähl Felder von einem Spielbrett. Die wertvollen Felder sind stillschweigend genau die Karten, die du am schlechtesten kannst — das Spiel lenkt dich auf deine Schwachstellen.","Study anything, any set, and your streak grows. Miss a day and it resets — which is exactly why it works.":"Lern irgendetwas, aus irgendeinem Set, und deine Serie wächst. Ein Tag Pause setzt sie zurück — genau deshalb funktioniert sie.","Every card moves Learning → Familiar → Mastered as it survives longer gaps. Watching the bar go green is the point.":"Jede Karte wandert von Lernen → Vertraut → Beherrscht, während sie längere Abstände übersteht. Zuzusehen, wie der Balken grün wird, ist der Punkt.","Your study home":"Dein Lernbereich","Build your questions as normal, then click":"Bau deine Fragen wie gewohnt und klick dann auf","Pick a mode in the":"Wähl einen Modus im","Everyone's phone shows what's at stake, and the big screen calls out the drama as each answer is revealed.":"Auf jedem Handy steht, worum es geht, und die große Leinwand macht aus jeder Auflösung ein Ereignis.","You can switch modes between rounds — start Classic, finish on Survival for a grand finale.":"Du kannst zwischen den Runden den Modus wechseln — starte mit Klassisch und beende mit Survival als großes Finale.","One point per correct answer, you reveal when you're ready. Exactly how PollSlide has always worked — nothing changes.":"Ein Punkt pro richtiger Antwort, du deckst auf, wenn du so weit bist. Genau so, wie PollSlide immer funktioniert hat — nichts ändert sich.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest. The reveal crowns a":"Je schneller du richtig antwortest, desto mehr Punkte — bis zum Doppelten für die Schnellsten. Die Auflösung krönt einen","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go. One miss resets it.":"Richtige Antworten in Folge steigern einen Multiplikator bis 3×, mit Flammen, die mitwachsen. Ein Fehler setzt ihn zurück.","One wrong answer and you're out. Knocked-out players keep watching, and the screen counts down who's still standing.":"Eine falsche Antwort und du bist raus. Ausgeschiedene schauen weiter zu, und der Bildschirm zählt herunter, wer noch steht.","Before each question players bet Safe (1×), Risky (2×) or Bold (3×). Get it wrong and it costs you.":"Vor jeder Frage setzen die Spieler auf Sicher (1×), Riskant (2×) oder Mutig (3×). Falsch geraten kostet.","📈 Everyone can see they're moving":"📈 Alle sehen, dass sich etwas bewegt","Whatever the mode, the leaderboard shows ▲ and ▼ arrows as people climb and slip — so the room feels the race, not just the scores.":"Egal in welchem Modus zeigt die Rangliste ▲- und ▼-Pfeile, wenn Leute steigen und fallen — so spürt der Raum das Rennen, nicht nur die Punkte.","Open the presentation you want to run and click":"Öffne die Präsentation, die du zeigen willst, und klick auf","Present as normal. After people type their name, they see a":"Präsentiere ganz normal. Nachdem die Leute ihren Namen eingegeben haben, sehen sie einen","The first person at a table taps":"Die erste Person am Tisch tippt auf","Anyone who'd rather play alone taps":"Wer lieber allein spielt, tippt auf","Your leaderboards, podium and Final Results now show":"Deine Ranglisten, das Podium und die Endergebnisse zeigen jetzt","⚖️ Big teams don't win by default":"⚖️ Große Teams gewinnen nicht automatisch","A team's score is the":"Die Punktzahl eines Teams ist der","📱 One phone each":"📱 Ein Handy pro Person","Everyone answers on their own phone — no passing a single device around, and everyone gets the questions in their own language if they need to.":"Alle antworten am eigenen Handy — kein Herumreichen eines Geräts, und wer will, bekommt die Fragen in der eigenen Sprache.","🔀 Latecomers are fine":"🔀 Nachzügler sind kein Problem","Turn team play on at any point. Anyone already in gets the team screen next time they answer, and people can join a team late.":"Schalt das Teamspiel jederzeit ein. Wer schon dabei ist, bekommt beim nächsten Antworten den Team-Bildschirm, und man kann einem Team auch später beitreten.","💀 Survival — the big screen":"💀 Survival — die große Leinwand","players drop out until one is left standing":"Spieler scheiden aus, bis eine Person übrig bleibt","Warm-up trivia appears automatically underneath the join banner while you're waiting.":"Aufwärmfragen erscheinen automatisch unter dem Beitritts-Banner, während du wartest.","Questions rotate on their own — each shows for a few seconds, reveals its answer, then moves on.":"Die Fragen wechseln von selbst — jede steht ein paar Sekunden, deckt ihre Antwort auf und geht weiter.","It disappears the instant you launch your first real question.":"Es verschwindet in dem Moment, in dem du deine erste echte Frage startest.","Don't want it? Click":"Nicht erwünscht? Klick auf","🚫 No spoilers":"🚫 Keine Spoiler","Warm-up questions come from a built-in general-knowledge set — never from your deck — so nothing in your actual quiz is given away.":"Die Aufwärmfragen stammen aus einem eingebauten Allgemeinwissens-Set — nie aus deinem Deck — damit nichts aus deinem eigentlichen Quiz verraten wird.","👀 Keeps the code on screen":"👀 Hält den Code auf dem Bildschirm","The join link, code and QR stay visible above the trivia, so latecomers can still get in while everyone else plays along.":"Beitrittslink, Code und QR bleiben über den Fragen sichtbar, damit Nachzügler noch reinkommen, während alle anderen mitspielen.","⚡ Zero setup":"⚡ Keinerlei Einrichtung","Nothing to configure and no AI needed — it works even if your internet or AI service is having a bad day.":"Nichts einzurichten und keine KI nötig — es funktioniert auch, wenn dein Internet oder der KI-Dienst gerade schwächelt.","Launch a question and let a few answers come in (you need at least":"Starte eine Frage und lass ein paar Antworten eintrudeln (du brauchst mindestens","Polly reads the actual responses and offers":"Polly liest die tatsächlichen Antworten und schlägt","Not useful? Close it. Nothing is added or launched unless you choose it.":"Nicht hilfreich? Schließ es. Es wird nichts hinzugefügt oder gestartet, außer du entscheidest dich dafür.","🧭 You're always in control":"🧭 Du behältst immer die Kontrolle","Polly never launches anything by itself. Every suggestion is a proposal you accept, edit later, or ignore.":"Polly startet nie etwas von selbst. Jeder Vorschlag ist ein Angebot, das du annimmst, später bearbeitest oder ignorierst.","Like AI Insights, this runs on PollSlide's own AI first rather than a third-party cloud, and it's included in your plan — not charged per use.":"Wie die KI-Analyse läuft das zuerst auf PollSlides eigener KI statt in einer Fremd-Cloud und ist in deinem Tarif enthalten — keine Abrechnung pro Nutzung.","🛟 Never blocks your session":"🛟 Blockiert nie deine Sitzung","If the AI can't be reached, you get a calm \"unavailable right now\" message. Your questions, results and reveal all carry on exactly as normal.":"Ist die KI nicht erreichbar, bekommst du eine ruhige Meldung „gerade nicht verfügbar“. Fragen, Ergebnisse und Auflösung laufen ganz normal weiter.","In the filters, choose the":"Wähl in den Filtern den","You get a link —":"Du bekommst einen Link —","Anyone with the link can open it. No sign-in, no app, works on any phone.":"Jede Person mit dem Link kann ihn öffnen. Kein Login, keine App, funktioniert auf jedem Handy.","🏆 The bits people care about":"🏆 Die Teile, die Leute interessieren","Winner (or winning team), leaderboard, how many took part, the toughest question, and a question-by-question breakdown.":"Sieger (oder Siegerteam), Rangliste, Teilnehmerzahl, die schwerste Frage und eine Aufschlüsselung Frage für Frage.","✨ With a summary when it fits":"✨ Mit einer Zusammenfassung, wenn es passt","If your session had written answers, Polly adds a one-line \"in a nutshell\" summary. If the AI isn't available, the recap still publishes with every stat intact.":"Gab es in deiner Sitzung schriftliche Antworten, ergänzt Polly eine einzeilige Kurzfassung. Ist die KI nicht verfügbar, erscheint der Rückblick trotzdem mit allen Zahlen.","🔗 Link-only, and yours to delete":"🔗 Nur per Link, und du kannst ihn löschen","The page is only reachable by its unguessable link — it isn't listed or searchable. It shows the display names people chose during the session.":"Die Seite ist nur über ihren nicht erratbaren Link erreichbar — sie ist nicht gelistet und nicht auffindbar. Sie zeigt die Anzeigenamen, die die Leute in der Sitzung gewählt haben.","In the left panel, the":"Im linken Bereich ist die","To file something, open a deck's":"Zum Einsortieren öffne das","Anything you create while inside a folder is filed there automatically.":"Alles, was du innerhalb eines Ordners erstellst, landet automatisch dort."},"fr":{"&larr; Back to pollslide.com":"&larr; Retour à pollslide.com","For teachers":"Pour les enseignants","📈 Progress over time":"📈 Progression dans le temps","📶 Answers survive bad wifi":"📶 Les réponses survivent à un mauvais wifi","🎞 GIFs, without the hunting":"🎞 Des GIF, sans la chasse","🎤 Atmosphere — how the wait feels":"🎤 Ambiance — le ressenti de l’attente","👥 Class lists":"👥 Listes de classe","🔐 Making sure it's really them":"🔐 S’assurer que c’est bien eux","🔁 Second attempts":"🔁 Deuxièmes tentatives","🎓 Gradebook export":"🎓 Export du carnet de notes","👁 Know if someone leaves the screen":"👁 Savoir si quelqu’un quitte l’écran","Each question has a QR code. Drop it on your Keynote, PowerPoint, or a PDF.":"Chaque question a un QR code. Placez-le dans votre Keynote, PowerPoint ou un PDF.","📱 No phone to scan the QR? No problem.":"📱 Pas de téléphone pour scanner le QR ? Aucun souci.","Anyone on a laptop (or any browser) can join without scanning: they go to":"Sur un ordinateur portable (ou n’importe quel navigateur), on peut rejoindre sans scanner : il suffit d’aller sur","So your audience always has both options, add this line":"Pour que votre public ait toujours les deux options, ajoutez cette ligne","In the app, the Share / QR window has a":"Dans l’application, la fenêtre Partager / QR comporte un","On a study set, click":"Sur un jeu de révision, cliquez sur","Got a quiz or poll instead? Click":"Vous avez plutôt un quiz ou un sondage ? Cliquez sur","You land on your":"Vous arrivez sur votre","Pick how you want to study today — then just keep coming back. The scheduler decides what you see next.":"Choisissez comment vous voulez réviser aujourd’hui — puis revenez, tout simplement. Le planificateur décide de la suite.","Flip cards and rate yourself Again / Hard / Good / Easy. Proper spaced repetition schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it.":"Retournez les cartes et notez-vous : Encore / Difficile / Bien / Facile. La vraie répétition espacée programme chaque carte pour le moment où vous êtes sur le point de l’oublier.","Sixty seconds, as many cards as you can get right, and a personal best to beat. Perfect when you've only got two minutes.":"Soixante secondes, autant de cartes que possible, et un record personnel à battre. Parfait quand vous n’avez que deux minutes.","Ten rungs of rising stakes with two lifelines and safe havens — bank your progress or risk it for the top. Game-show tension, real revision.":"Dix paliers d’enjeux croissants avec deux jokers et des paliers sûrs — encaissez vos gains ou risquez tout pour le sommet. Tension de jeu télévisé, vraies révisions.","Choose squares from a board. The high-value squares are quietly the cards you know least well, so the game steers you at your weak spots.":"Choisissez des cases sur un plateau. Les cases les plus chères sont discrètement les cartes que vous maîtrisez le moins : le jeu vous oriente vers vos points faibles.","Study anything, any set, and your streak grows. Miss a day and it resets — which is exactly why it works.":"Révisez n’importe quoi, dans n’importe quel jeu, et votre série grandit. Sautez un jour et elle repart de zéro — c’est précisément pour ça que ça marche.","Every card moves Learning → Familiar → Mastered as it survives longer gaps. Watching the bar go green is the point.":"Chaque carte passe d’Apprentissage → Familier → Maîtrisé à mesure qu’elle survit à des intervalles plus longs. Voir la barre virer au vert, c’est tout l’intérêt.","Your study home":"Votre espace de révision","Build your questions as normal, then click":"Créez vos questions comme d’habitude, puis cliquez sur","Pick a mode in the":"Choisissez un mode dans la","Everyone's phone shows what's at stake, and the big screen calls out the drama as each answer is revealed.":"Le téléphone de chacun montre ce qui est en jeu, et le grand écran met en scène la tension à chaque réponse révélée.","You can switch modes between rounds — start Classic, finish on Survival for a grand finale.":"Vous pouvez changer de mode entre les manches — commencez en Classique et terminez en Survie pour une grande finale.","One point per correct answer, you reveal when you're ready. Exactly how PollSlide has always worked — nothing changes.":"Un point par bonne réponse, vous révélez quand vous voulez. Exactement comme PollSlide a toujours fonctionné — rien ne change.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest. The reveal crowns a":"Plus vous répondez juste vite, plus vous marquez — jusqu’au double pour les plus rapides. La révélation couronne un","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go. One miss resets it.":"Les bonnes réponses d’affilée font monter un multiplicateur jusqu’à 3×, avec des flammes qui grandissent. Une erreur remet tout à zéro.","One wrong answer and you're out. Knocked-out players keep watching, and the screen counts down who's still standing.":"Une mauvaise réponse et vous êtes éliminé. Les éliminés continuent de regarder, et l’écran décompte qui tient encore.","Before each question players bet Safe (1×), Risky (2×) or Bold (3×). Get it wrong and it costs you.":"Avant chaque question, les joueurs misent Sûr (1×), Risqué (2×) ou Audacieux (3×). Se tromper coûte cher.","📈 Everyone can see they're moving":"📈 Chacun voit qu’il bouge","Whatever the mode, the leaderboard shows ▲ and ▼ arrows as people climb and slip — so the room feels the race, not just the scores.":"Quel que soit le mode, le classement affiche des flèches ▲ et ▼ quand on monte ou qu’on glisse — la salle sent la course, pas seulement les scores.","Open the presentation you want to run and click":"Ouvrez la présentation que vous voulez lancer et cliquez sur","Present as normal. After people type their name, they see a":"Présentez normalement. Après avoir saisi leur nom, les participants voient un","The first person at a table taps":"La première personne à une table appuie sur","Anyone who'd rather play alone taps":"Ceux qui préfèrent jouer seuls appuient sur","Your leaderboards, podium and Final Results now show":"Vos classements, le podium et les Résultats finaux affichent désormais","⚖️ Big teams don't win by default":"⚖️ Les grandes équipes ne gagnent pas d’office","A team's score is the":"Le score d’une équipe est la","📱 One phone each":"📱 Un téléphone chacun","Everyone answers on their own phone — no passing a single device around, and everyone gets the questions in their own language if they need to.":"Chacun répond sur son propre téléphone — pas d’appareil à faire circuler, et chacun reçoit les questions dans sa langue s’il en a besoin.","🔀 Latecomers are fine":"🔀 Les retardataires ne posent pas de problème","Turn team play on at any point. Anyone already in gets the team screen next time they answer, and people can join a team late.":"Activez le jeu en équipes à tout moment. Ceux qui sont déjà là verront l’écran d’équipe à leur prochaine réponse, et on peut rejoindre une équipe en retard.","💀 Survival — the big screen":"💀 Survie — le grand écran","players drop out until one is left standing":"les joueurs sont éliminés jusqu’à ce qu’il n’en reste qu’un","Warm-up trivia appears automatically underneath the join banner while you're waiting.":"Les questions d’échauffement apparaissent automatiquement sous la bannière d’accès pendant l’attente.","Questions rotate on their own — each shows for a few seconds, reveals its answer, then moves on.":"Les questions défilent toutes seules — chacune s’affiche quelques secondes, révèle sa réponse, puis passe.","It disappears the instant you launch your first real question.":"Cela disparaît dès que vous lancez votre première vraie question.","Don't want it? Click":"Vous n’en voulez pas ? Cliquez sur","🚫 No spoilers":"🚫 Aucun spoiler","Warm-up questions come from a built-in general-knowledge set — never from your deck — so nothing in your actual quiz is given away.":"Les questions d’échauffement viennent d’un jeu de culture générale intégré — jamais du vôtre — pour ne rien dévoiler de votre vrai quiz.","👀 Keeps the code on screen":"👀 Garde le code à l’écran","The join link, code and QR stay visible above the trivia, so latecomers can still get in while everyone else plays along.":"Le lien, le code et le QR restent visibles au-dessus des questions, pour que les retardataires puissent encore entrer pendant que les autres jouent.","⚡ Zero setup":"⚡ Aucune configuration","Nothing to configure and no AI needed — it works even if your internet or AI service is having a bad day.":"Rien à configurer et aucune IA nécessaire — ça marche même si votre connexion ou le service d’IA a un mauvais jour.","Launch a question and let a few answers come in (you need at least":"Lancez une question et laissez quelques réponses arriver (il en faut au moins","Polly reads the actual responses and offers":"Polly lit les réponses réelles et propose","Not useful? Close it. Nothing is added or launched unless you choose it.":"Pas utile ? Fermez. Rien n’est ajouté ni lancé sans votre accord.","🧭 You're always in control":"🧭 Vous gardez toujours la main","Polly never launches anything by itself. Every suggestion is a proposal you accept, edit later, or ignore.":"Polly ne lance jamais rien toute seule. Chaque suggestion est une proposition que vous acceptez, modifiez ensuite, ou ignorez.","Like AI Insights, this runs on PollSlide's own AI first rather than a third-party cloud, and it's included in your plan — not charged per use.":"Comme l’Analyse IA, cela tourne d’abord sur l’IA propre à PollSlide plutôt que sur un cloud tiers, et c’est inclus dans votre formule — sans facturation à l’usage.","🛟 Never blocks your session":"🛟 Ne bloque jamais votre session","If the AI can't be reached, you get a calm \"unavailable right now\" message. Your questions, results and reveal all carry on exactly as normal.":"Si l’IA est injoignable, vous voyez un message sobre « indisponible pour le moment ». Vos questions, résultats et révélation continuent exactement comme d’habitude.","In the filters, choose the":"Dans les filtres, choisissez la","You get a link —":"Vous obtenez un lien —","Anyone with the link can open it. No sign-in, no app, works on any phone.":"Toute personne ayant le lien peut l’ouvrir. Sans connexion, sans application, sur n’importe quel téléphone.","🏆 The bits people care about":"🏆 Ce qui intéresse vraiment les gens","Winner (or winning team), leaderboard, how many took part, the toughest question, and a question-by-question breakdown.":"Gagnant (ou équipe gagnante), classement, nombre de participants, la question la plus difficile, et un détail question par question.","✨ With a summary when it fits":"✨ Avec un résumé quand c’est pertinent","If your session had written answers, Polly adds a one-line \"in a nutshell\" summary. If the AI isn't available, the recap still publishes with every stat intact.":"Si votre session comportait des réponses écrites, Polly ajoute un résumé d’une ligne. Si l’IA n’est pas disponible, le récapitulatif est publié quand même, avec toutes les statistiques.","🔗 Link-only, and yours to delete":"🔗 Uniquement par lien, et vous pouvez le supprimer","The page is only reachable by its unguessable link — it isn't listed or searchable. It shows the display names people chose during the session.":"La page n’est accessible que par son lien impossible à deviner — elle n’est ni référencée ni consultable. Elle affiche les noms choisis par les participants pendant la session.","In the left panel, the":"Dans le panneau de gauche, le","To file something, open a deck's":"Pour classer quelque chose, ouvrez le","Anything you create while inside a folder is filed there automatically.":"Tout ce que vous créez à l’intérieur d’un dossier y est classé automatiquement."},"pt":{"&larr; Back to pollslide.com":"&larr; Voltar a pollslide.com","For teachers":"Para docentes","📈 Progress over time":"📈 Progresso ao longo do tempo","📶 Answers survive bad wifi":"📶 As respostas sobrevivem a mau wifi","🎞 GIFs, without the hunting":"🎞 GIFs, sem ter de os caçar","🎤 Atmosphere — how the wait feels":"🎤 Ambiente — como se sente a espera","👥 Class lists":"👥 Listas de turma","🔐 Making sure it's really them":"🔐 Garantir que são mesmo eles","🔁 Second attempts":"🔁 Segundas tentativas","🎓 Gradebook export":"🎓 Exportar a pauta","👁 Know if someone leaves the screen":"👁 Saber se alguém sai do ecrã","Each question has a QR code. Drop it on your Keynote, PowerPoint, or a PDF.":"Cada pergunta tem um código QR. Ponha-o no seu Keynote, PowerPoint ou num PDF.","📱 No phone to scan the QR? No problem.":"📱 Sem telemóvel para ler o QR? Sem problema.","Anyone on a laptop (or any browser) can join without scanning: they go to":"Quem estiver num portátil (ou em qualquer navegador) pode entrar sem ler o QR: vai a","So your audience always has both options, add this line":"Para o seu público ter sempre as duas opções, acrescente esta linha","In the app, the Share / QR window has a":"Na app, a janela Partilhar / QR tem um","On a study set, click":"Num conjunto de estudo, clique em","Got a quiz or poll instead? Click":"Tem antes um quiz ou uma sondagem? Clique em","You land on your":"Chega ao seu","Pick how you want to study today — then just keep coming back. The scheduler decides what you see next.":"Escolha como quer estudar hoje — e depois volte, simplesmente. O planeador decide o que vê a seguir.","Flip cards and rate yourself Again / Hard / Good / Easy. Proper spaced repetition schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it.":"Vire os cartões e avalie-se: Outra vez / Difícil / Bom / Fácil. A repetição espaçada a sério agenda cada cartão para o momento em que está prestes a esquecê-lo.","Sixty seconds, as many cards as you can get right, and a personal best to beat. Perfect when you've only got two minutes.":"Sessenta segundos, tantos cartões quantos conseguir acertar, e um recorde pessoal para bater. Perfeito quando só tem dois minutos.","Ten rungs of rising stakes with two lifelines and safe havens — bank your progress or risk it for the top. Game-show tension, real revision.":"Dez degraus de risco crescente com dois cartões de ajuda e patamares seguros — garanta o progresso ou arrisque pelo topo. Tensão de concurso, revisão a sério.","Choose squares from a board. The high-value squares are quietly the cards you know least well, so the game steers you at your weak spots.":"Escolha casas de um tabuleiro. As casas de maior valor são, discretamente, os cartões que sabe pior, por isso o jogo leva-o aos seus pontos fracos.","Study anything, any set, and your streak grows. Miss a day and it resets — which is exactly why it works.":"Estude o que for, de qualquer conjunto, e a sua sequência cresce. Falhe um dia e reinicia — que é exatamente porque funciona.","Every card moves Learning → Familiar → Mastered as it survives longer gaps. Watching the bar go green is the point.":"Cada cartão passa de A aprender → Familiar → Dominado à medida que sobrevive a intervalos maiores. Ver a barra ficar verde é mesmo o objetivo.","Your study home":"O seu espaço de estudo","Build your questions as normal, then click":"Crie as perguntas como sempre e depois clique em","Pick a mode in the":"Escolha um modo no","Everyone's phone shows what's at stake, and the big screen calls out the drama as each answer is revealed.":"O telemóvel de cada um mostra o que está em jogo, e o ecrã grande narra a tensão à medida que cada resposta é revelada.","You can switch modes between rounds — start Classic, finish on Survival for a grand finale.":"Pode mudar de modo entre rondas — comece em Clássico e termine em Sobrevivência para um grande final.","One point per correct answer, you reveal when you're ready. Exactly how PollSlide has always worked — nothing changes.":"Um ponto por resposta certa e revela quando quiser. Exatamente como o PollSlide sempre funcionou — nada muda.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest. The reveal crowns a":"Quanto mais depressa acertar, mais pontua — até ao dobro para os mais rápidos. A revelação coroa um","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go. One miss resets it.":"Os acertos seguidos aumentam um multiplicador até 3×, com chamas que crescem. Um erro reinicia-o.","One wrong answer and you're out. Knocked-out players keep watching, and the screen counts down who's still standing.":"Uma resposta errada e está fora. Quem cai continua a ver, e o ecrã vai contando quem ainda está de pé.","Before each question players bet Safe (1×), Risky (2×) or Bold (3×). Get it wrong and it costs you.":"Antes de cada pergunta aposta-se Seguro (1×), Arriscado (2×) ou Ousado (3×). Se errar, custa-lhe.","📈 Everyone can see they're moving":"📈 Toda a gente vê que se mexe","Whatever the mode, the leaderboard shows ▲ and ▼ arrows as people climb and slip — so the room feels the race, not just the scores.":"Seja qual for o modo, a classificação mostra setas ▲ e ▼ quando alguém sobe ou desce — assim a sala sente a corrida, não só os pontos.","Open the presentation you want to run and click":"Abra a apresentação que quer usar e clique em","Present as normal. After people type their name, they see a":"Apresente normalmente. Depois de escreverem o nome, veem um","The first person at a table taps":"A primeira pessoa da mesa toca em","Anyone who'd rather play alone taps":"Quem preferir jogar sozinho toca em","Your leaderboards, podium and Final Results now show":"As suas classificações, o pódio e os Resultados finais passam a mostrar","⚖️ Big teams don't win by default":"⚖️ As equipas grandes não ganham à partida","A team's score is the":"A pontuação de uma equipa é a","📱 One phone each":"📱 Um telemóvel por pessoa","Everyone answers on their own phone — no passing a single device around, and everyone gets the questions in their own language if they need to.":"Cada um responde no seu telemóvel — nada de passar um aparelho, e quem precisar recebe as perguntas no seu idioma.","🔀 Latecomers are fine":"🔀 Os atrasados não são problema","Turn team play on at any point. Anyone already in gets the team screen next time they answer, and people can join a team late.":"Ligue o jogo por equipas quando quiser. Quem já está dentro vê o ecrã de equipas na próxima resposta, e é possível entrar numa equipa mais tarde.","💀 Survival — the big screen":"💀 Sobrevivência — o ecrã grande","players drop out until one is left standing":"os jogadores vão caindo até restar um","Warm-up trivia appears automatically underneath the join banner while you're waiting.":"As perguntas de aquecimento aparecem sozinhas por baixo do painel de entrada enquanto espera.","Questions rotate on their own — each shows for a few seconds, reveals its answer, then moves on.":"As perguntas rodam sozinhas — cada uma aparece uns segundos, revela a resposta e segue.","It disappears the instant you launch your first real question.":"Desaparece assim que lança a sua primeira pergunta a sério.","Don't want it? Click":"Não quer? Clique em","🚫 No spoilers":"🚫 Sem spoilers","Warm-up questions come from a built-in general-knowledge set — never from your deck — so nothing in your actual quiz is given away.":"As perguntas de aquecimento vêm de um conjunto de cultura geral incorporado — nunca do seu baralho — para não revelar nada do seu quiz real.","👀 Keeps the code on screen":"👀 Mantém o código no ecrã","The join link, code and QR stay visible above the trivia, so latecomers can still get in while everyone else plays along.":"O link, o código e o QR mantêm-se visíveis por cima das perguntas, para os atrasados poderem entrar enquanto os outros jogam.","⚡ Zero setup":"⚡ Zero configuração","Nothing to configure and no AI needed — it works even if your internet or AI service is having a bad day.":"Nada para configurar e sem precisar de IA — funciona mesmo que a sua internet ou o serviço de IA estejam com um mau dia.","Launch a question and let a few answers come in (you need at least":"Lance uma pergunta e deixe chegar algumas respostas (precisa de pelo menos","Polly reads the actual responses and offers":"A Polly lê as respostas reais e propõe","Not useful? Close it. Nothing is added or launched unless you choose it.":"Não é útil? Feche. Nada é acrescentado ou lançado a não ser que escolha.","🧭 You're always in control":"🧭 O controlo é sempre seu","Polly never launches anything by itself. Every suggestion is a proposal you accept, edit later, or ignore.":"A Polly nunca lança nada sozinha. Cada sugestão é uma proposta que aceita, edita depois, ou ignora.","Like AI Insights, this runs on PollSlide's own AI first rather than a third-party cloud, and it's included in your plan — not charged per use.":"Tal como a Análise IA, isto corre primeiro na IA própria do PollSlide e não numa nuvem de terceiros, e está incluído no seu plano — não é cobrado por utilização.","🛟 Never blocks your session":"🛟 Nunca bloqueia a sua sessão","If the AI can't be reached, you get a calm \"unavailable right now\" message. Your questions, results and reveal all carry on exactly as normal.":"Se não for possível chegar à IA, recebe uma mensagem calma de «indisponível neste momento». As perguntas, os resultados e a revelação continuam exatamente na mesma.","In the filters, choose the":"Nos filtros, escolha o","You get a link —":"Recebe um link —","Anyone with the link can open it. No sign-in, no app, works on any phone.":"Qualquer pessoa com o link pode abri-lo. Sem iniciar sessão, sem app, funciona em qualquer telemóvel.","🏆 The bits people care about":"🏆 As partes que interessam às pessoas","Winner (or winning team), leaderboard, how many took part, the toughest question, and a question-by-question breakdown.":"Vencedor (ou equipa vencedora), classificação, quantos participaram, a pergunta mais difícil, e um detalhe pergunta a pergunta.","✨ With a summary when it fits":"✨ Com um resumo quando faz sentido","If your session had written answers, Polly adds a one-line \"in a nutshell\" summary. If the AI isn't available, the recap still publishes with every stat intact.":"Se a sua sessão teve respostas escritas, a Polly acrescenta um resumo de uma linha. Se a IA não estiver disponível, o resumo é publicado na mesma com todas as estatísticas.","🔗 Link-only, and yours to delete":"🔗 Só por link, e é seu para apagar","The page is only reachable by its unguessable link — it isn't listed or searchable. It shows the display names people chose during the session.":"A página só é acessível pelo seu link impossível de adivinhar — não está listada nem é pesquisável. Mostra os nomes que as pessoas escolheram durante a sessão.","In the left panel, the":"No painel esquerdo, o","To file something, open a deck's":"Para arquivar algo, abra o","Anything you create while inside a folder is filed there automatically.":"Tudo o que criar dentro de uma pasta fica lá arquivado automaticamente."},"it":{"&larr; Back to pollslide.com":"&larr; Torna a pollslide.com","For teachers":"Per insegnanti","📈 Progress over time":"📈 Progressi nel tempo","📶 Answers survive bad wifi":"📶 Le risposte sopravvivono al wifi scadente","🎞 GIFs, without the hunting":"🎞 GIF, senza doverle cercare","🎤 Atmosphere — how the wait feels":"🎤 Atmosfera — come si vive l’attesa","👥 Class lists":"👥 Elenchi della classe","🔐 Making sure it's really them":"🔐 Assicurarsi che siano davvero loro","🔁 Second attempts":"🔁 Secondi tentativi","🎓 Gradebook export":"🎓 Esportare il registro","👁 Know if someone leaves the screen":"👁 Sapere se qualcuno esce dalla schermata","Each question has a QR code. Drop it on your Keynote, PowerPoint, or a PDF.":"Ogni domanda ha un codice QR. Mettilo nel tuo Keynote, PowerPoint o in un PDF.","📱 No phone to scan the QR? No problem.":"📱 Nessun telefono per scansionare il QR? Nessun problema.","Anyone on a laptop (or any browser) can join without scanning: they go to":"Chi è su un portatile (o su qualsiasi browser) può entrare senza scansionare: va su","So your audience always has both options, add this line":"Perché il pubblico abbia sempre entrambe le opzioni, aggiungi questa riga","In the app, the Share / QR window has a":"Nell’app, la finestra Condividi / QR ha un","On a study set, click":"In un set di studio, clicca","Got a quiz or poll instead? Click":"Hai invece un quiz o un sondaggio? Clicca","You land on your":"Arrivi sulla tua","Pick how you want to study today — then just keep coming back. The scheduler decides what you see next.":"Scegli come vuoi studiare oggi — poi torna e basta. Il pianificatore decide cosa vedrai dopo.","Flip cards and rate yourself Again / Hard / Good / Easy. Proper spaced repetition schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it.":"Gira le carte e valutati: Ancora / Difficile / Bene / Facile. La vera ripetizione dilazionata programma ogni carta per il momento in cui stai per dimenticarla.","Sixty seconds, as many cards as you can get right, and a personal best to beat. Perfect when you've only got two minutes.":"Sessanta secondi, quante più carte indovini, e un record personale da battere. Perfetto quando hai solo due minuti.","Ten rungs of rising stakes with two lifelines and safe havens — bank your progress or risk it for the top. Game-show tension, real revision.":"Dieci gradini a posta crescente con due aiuti e soglie sicure — incassa i progressi o rischiali per la vetta. Tensione da quiz show, ripasso vero.","Choose squares from a board. The high-value squares are quietly the cards you know least well, so the game steers you at your weak spots.":"Scegli le caselle da un tabellone. Quelle di valore più alto sono, senza dirlo, le carte che sai peggio: il gioco ti porta sui tuoi punti deboli.","Study anything, any set, and your streak grows. Miss a day and it resets — which is exactly why it works.":"Studia qualsiasi cosa, da qualsiasi set, e la tua serie cresce. Salta un giorno e si azzera — ed è esattamente per questo che funziona.","Every card moves Learning → Familiar → Mastered as it survives longer gaps. Watching the bar go green is the point.":"Ogni carta passa da In apprendimento → Familiare → Padroneggiata man mano che supera intervalli più lunghi. Guardare la barra diventare verde è il punto.","Your study home":"Il tuo spazio di studio","Build your questions as normal, then click":"Crea le domande come al solito, poi clicca","Pick a mode in the":"Scegli una modalità nella","Everyone's phone shows what's at stake, and the big screen calls out the drama as each answer is revealed.":"Il telefono di ognuno mostra la posta in gioco, e il grande schermo racconta la tensione a ogni risposta rivelata.","You can switch modes between rounds — start Classic, finish on Survival for a grand finale.":"Puoi cambiare modalità tra un round e l’altro — inizia in Classica e chiudi con Sopravvivenza per un gran finale.","One point per correct answer, you reveal when you're ready. Exactly how PollSlide has always worked — nothing changes.":"Un punto per ogni risposta corretta, riveli quando vuoi. Esattamente come PollSlide ha sempre funzionato — non cambia nulla.","The faster you answer correctly, the more you score — up to double points for the quickest. The reveal crowns a":"Più rispondi in fretta e correttamente, più punti fai — fino al doppio per i più rapidi. La rivelazione incorona un","Correct answers in a row build a multiplier up to 3×, with flames that grow as you go. One miss resets it.":"Le risposte esatte di fila aumentano un moltiplicatore fino a 3×, con fiamme che crescono. Un errore lo azzera.","One wrong answer and you're out. Knocked-out players keep watching, and the screen counts down who's still standing.":"Una risposta sbagliata e sei fuori. Chi è eliminato continua a guardare, e lo schermo conta chi è ancora in gioco.","Before each question players bet Safe (1×), Risky (2×) or Bold (3×). Get it wrong and it costs you.":"Prima di ogni domanda si punta Sicuro (1×), Rischioso (2×) o Audace (3×). Sbagliare costa.","📈 Everyone can see they're moving":"📈 Tutti vedono che si muovono","Whatever the mode, the leaderboard shows ▲ and ▼ arrows as people climb and slip — so the room feels the race, not just the scores.":"Qualunque sia la modalità, la classifica mostra frecce ▲ e ▼ quando si sale o si scende — così la sala sente la gara, non solo i punteggi.","Open the presentation you want to run and click":"Apri la presentazione che vuoi usare e clicca","Present as normal. After people type their name, they see a":"Presenta normalmente. Dopo aver scritto il nome, vedono una","The first person at a table taps":"La prima persona al tavolo tocca","Anyone who'd rather play alone taps":"Chi preferisce giocare da solo tocca","Your leaderboards, podium and Final Results now show":"Le tue classifiche, il podio e i Risultati finali ora mostrano","⚖️ Big teams don't win by default":"⚖️ Le squadre numerose non vincono di default","A team's score is the":"Il punteggio di una squadra è la","📱 One phone each":"📱 Un telefono a testa","Everyone answers on their own phone — no passing a single device around, and everyone gets the questions in their own language if they need to.":"Ognuno risponde dal proprio telefono — nessun dispositivo da passare in giro, e chi ne ha bisogno riceve le domande nella propria lingua.","🔀 Latecomers are fine":"🔀 I ritardatari non sono un problema","Turn team play on at any point. Anyone already in gets the team screen next time they answer, and people can join a team late.":"Attiva il gioco a squadre quando vuoi. Chi è già dentro vedrà la schermata delle squadre alla risposta successiva, e ci si può unire a una squadra anche dopo.","💀 Survival — the big screen":"💀 Sopravvivenza — il grande schermo","players drop out until one is left standing":"i giocatori vengono eliminati finché ne resta uno","Warm-up trivia appears automatically underneath the join banner while you're waiting.":"Le domande di riscaldamento compaiono da sole sotto il banner d’accesso mentre aspetti.","Questions rotate on their own — each shows for a few seconds, reveals its answer, then moves on.":"Le domande ruotano da sole — ognuna resta qualche secondo, rivela la risposta e passa avanti.","It disappears the instant you launch your first real question.":"Sparisce nell’istante in cui lanci la tua prima domanda vera.","Don't want it? Click":"Non lo vuoi? Clicca","🚫 No spoilers":"🚫 Nessuno spoiler","Warm-up questions come from a built-in general-knowledge set — never from your deck — so nothing in your actual quiz is given away.":"Le domande di riscaldamento vengono da un set di cultura generale integrato — mai dal tuo mazzo — così non si rivela nulla del quiz vero.","👀 Keeps the code on screen":"👀 Tiene il codice sullo schermo","The join link, code and QR stay visible above the trivia, so latecomers can still get in while everyone else plays along.":"Link, codice e QR restano visibili sopra le domande, così i ritardatari possono ancora entrare mentre gli altri giocano.","⚡ Zero setup":"⚡ Zero configurazione","Nothing to configure and no AI needed — it works even if your internet or AI service is having a bad day.":"Niente da configurare e nessuna IA necessaria — funziona anche se la tua connessione o il servizio IA hanno una giornata storta.","Launch a question and let a few answers come in (you need at least":"Lancia una domanda e lascia arrivare qualche risposta (te ne servono almeno","Polly reads the actual responses and offers":"Polly legge le risposte reali e propone","Not useful? Close it. Nothing is added or launched unless you choose it.":"Non ti serve? Chiudilo. Non viene aggiunto o lanciato nulla se non lo scegli tu.","🧭 You're always in control":"🧭 Il controllo è sempre tuo","Polly never launches anything by itself. Every suggestion is a proposal you accept, edit later, or ignore.":"Polly non lancia mai nulla da sola. Ogni suggerimento è una proposta che accetti, modifichi dopo, o ignori.","Like AI Insights, this runs on PollSlide's own AI first rather than a third-party cloud, and it's included in your plan — not charged per use.":"Come l’Analisi IA, gira prima sull’IA di PollSlide e non su un cloud di terzi, ed è incluso nel tuo piano — non si paga a consumo.","🛟 Never blocks your session":"🛟 Non blocca mai la tua sessione","If the AI can't be reached, you get a calm \"unavailable right now\" message. Your questions, results and reveal all carry on exactly as normal.":"Se l’IA non è raggiungibile, ricevi un messaggio pacato «non disponibile al momento». Domande, risultati e rivelazione proseguono esattamente come sempre.","In the filters, choose the":"Nei filtri, scegli il","You get a link —":"Ottieni un link —","Anyone with the link can open it. No sign-in, no app, works on any phone.":"Chiunque abbia il link può aprirlo. Nessun accesso, nessuna app, funziona su qualsiasi telefono.","🏆 The bits people care about":"🏆 Le parti che interessano davvero","Winner (or winning team), leaderboard, how many took part, the toughest question, and a question-by-question breakdown.":"Vincitore (o squadra vincitrice), classifica, quanti hanno partecipato, la domanda più difficile e un dettaglio domanda per domanda.","✨ With a summary when it fits":"✨ Con un riepilogo quando ha senso","If your session had written answers, Polly adds a one-line \"in a nutshell\" summary. If the AI isn't available, the recap still publishes with every stat intact.":"Se la sessione aveva risposte scritte, Polly aggiunge un riepilogo di una riga. Se l’IA non è disponibile, il riepilogo viene pubblicato comunque con tutti i dati.","🔗 Link-only, and yours to delete":"🔗 Solo via link, e sei tu a poterlo eliminare","The page is only reachable by its unguessable link — it isn't listed or searchable. It shows the display names people chose during the session.":"La pagina è raggiungibile solo dal suo link non indovinabile — non è elencata né ricercabile. Mostra i nomi scelti dalle persone durante la sessione.","In the left panel, the":"Nel pannello di sinistra, il","To file something, open a deck's":"Per archiviare qualcosa, apri il","Anything you create while inside a folder is filed there automatically.":"Tutto ciò che crei dentro una cartella viene archiviato lì automaticamente."}});

