;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es":{"Trust & Safety — PollSlide":"Confianza y seguridad — PollSlide","Our commitment.":"Nuestro compromiso.","for the full legal position.":"para la posición legal completa.","Profanity filtering.":"Filtrado de lenguaje ofensivo.","Free-text answers, participant display names, and live audience questions are automatically screened against a profanity filter and masked.":"Las respuestas de texto libre, los nombres visibles y las preguntas del público se filtran automáticamente contra un filtro de lenguaje ofensivo y se enmascaran.","Link & spam filtering.":"Filtrado de enlaces y spam.","Web links are automatically stripped from audience-submitted text and names, reducing spam and phishing risk on the projected screen.":"Los enlaces web se eliminan automáticamente del texto y los nombres enviados por el público, reduciendo el riesgo de spam y phishing en la pantalla proyectada.","Name moderation.":"Moderación de nombres.","Display names are filtered for profanity and links; a name that fails moderation is rejected.":"Los nombres visibles se filtran por lenguaje ofensivo y enlaces; un nombre que no pase la moderación se rechaza.","Presenter moderation controls.":"Controles de moderación del presentador.","Hosts can hide, mark-answered, remove, and reset audience questions and responses at any time.":"Quien presenta puede ocultar, marcar como respondidas, eliminar y reiniciar las preguntas y respuestas del público en cualquier momento.","AI image safety.":"Seguridad de las imágenes con IA.","AI-generated images run through the provider's safety filter.":"Las imágenes generadas con IA pasan por el filtro de seguridad del proveedor.","Flood protection.":"Protección contra inundaciones de envíos.","Rate limits and per-session caps limit how much any single participant can submit.":"Los límites de frecuencia y los topes por sesión limitan cuánto puede enviar una sola persona.","Minimal data.":"Datos mínimos.","Audience members don't create accounts — they join with a code or QR and provide only a display name and their answers.":"El público no crea cuentas: entra con un código o un QR y solo aporta un nombre visible y sus respuestas.","Clear data roles.":"Roles de datos claros.","The presenter is the data controller for their participants' data; PollSlide acts as a processor on their behalf. See our":"Quien presenta es el responsable del tratamiento de los datos de sus participantes; PollSlide actúa como encargado en su nombre. Consulta nuestro","Sensitive data.":"Datos sensibles.","rules prohibit collecting sensitive personal data without explicit, informed consent.":"prohíben recopilar datos personales sensibles sin consentimiento explícito e informado.","Your data, recoverable & deletable.":"Tus datos, recuperables y borrables.","Presenters can export their data (CSV) and delete it; resets are snapshotted first so nothing is lost by accident.":"Quien presenta puede exportar sus datos (CSV) y borrarlos; los reinicios se guardan antes en una instantánea para que nada se pierda por accidente.","Encryption in transit.":"Cifrado en tránsito.","All traffic uses HTTPS/TLS.":"Todo el tráfico usa HTTPS/TLS.","Trusted infrastructure.":"Infraestructura de confianza.","Authentication and data are handled by Google Firebase; the app is served on Vercel.":"La autenticación y los datos los gestiona Google Firebase; la app se sirve en Vercel.","Access controls.":"Controles de acceso.","Team workspaces use role-based permissions; seat limits are enforced server-side.":"Los espacios de equipo usan permisos por rol; los límites de plazas se aplican en el servidor.","— harassment, hate, illegal material, spam, or infringement — please report it so we can act:":"—acoso, odio, material ilegal, spam o infracciones—, denúncialo para que podamos actuar:","Include the session code and a description (and a screenshot if possible). We review reports promptly and may remove content or suspend the session or account responsible.":"Incluye el código de sesión y una descripción (y una captura si es posible). Revisamos las denuncias con rapidez y podemos retirar contenido o suspender la sesión o la cuenta responsable.","PollSlide Technologies LLC ·":"PollSlide Technologies LLC ·","Accessibility Statement — PollSlide":"Declaración de accesibilidad — PollSlide","— our marketing and help website.":"—nuestro sitio de marketing y ayuda.","— the PollSlide web application: the presenter workspace, the participant answer page (":"—la aplicación web de PollSlide: el espacio del presentador, la página de respuesta del participante (","app.pollslide.com/answer":"app.pollslide.com/answer",", reached via QR code or":", al que se llega por código QR o","), live results, reports and shared decks.":"), los resultados en directo, los informes y las barajas compartidas.","— our macOS app, which follows Apple's macOS accessibility frameworks (VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast).":"—nuestra app para macOS, que sigue los marcos de accesibilidad de macOS de Apple (VoiceOver, Reducir movimiento, Aumentar contraste).","Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA":"Pautas de Accesibilidad para el Contenido Web (WCAG) 2.1, nivel AA",". WCAG 2.1 AA is the benchmark referenced by the harmonised European standard":". WCAG 2.1 AA es la referencia que utiliza la norma europea armonizada","(which underpins the":"(que sustenta la","European Accessibility Act":"Ley Europea de Accesibilidad",", Directive (EU) 2019/882), by the UK Equality Act 2010 guidance, and by U.S. ADA web-accessibility best practice and Section 508.":", Directiva (UE) 2019/882), por las orientaciones de la Equality Act 2010 del Reino Unido y por las buenas prácticas de accesibilidad web de la ADA de EE. UU. y la Sección 508.","Partially conformant.":"Parcialmente conforme.","Keyboard access:":"Acceso por teclado:","the participant answer flow (join by code, choose an option, type an answer, submit) is operable with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.":"el flujo de respuesta del participante (entrar con código, elegir una opción, escribir una respuesta, enviar) se puede manejar con teclado, con indicadores de foco visibles.","No forced time limits:":"Sin límites de tiempo forzados:","PollSlide itself does not impose time limits on answering; timing is always under the presenter's control.":"PollSlide no impone por sí mismo límites de tiempo para responder; los tiempos siempre los controla quien presenta.","Zoom and reflow:":"Zoom y reajuste:","pages use responsive layouts and remain usable at 200% browser zoom; the participant page is a simple single-column layout.":"las páginas usan diseños adaptables y siguen siendo usables con un zoom del navegador del 200 %; la página del participante es de una sola columna.","Dark and light themes":"Temas claro y oscuro","across the website and apps, respecting your system preference.":"en el sitio web y las apps, respetando la preferencia de tu sistema.","Reduced motion:":"Movimiento reducido:","animations (including celebration effects) are disabled for users whose system requests reduced motion.":"las animaciones (incluidos los efectos de celebración) se desactivan para quienes tienen configurado el movimiento reducido en su sistema.","Multiple languages:":"Varios idiomas:","the participant experience is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese and Italian.":"la experiencia del participante está disponible en inglés, español, alemán, francés, portugués e italiano.","Text alternatives to visuals:":"Alternativas textuales a los elementos visuales:","live results shown as charts are also available as text and numbers, and presenters can export full results as CSV from the report page.":"los resultados en directo mostrados como gráficos también están disponibles en texto y números, y quien presenta puede exportar los resultados completos en CSV desde la página de informe.","and enter the session code.":"e introduce el código de sesión.","(subject: \"Accessibility\")":"(asunto: «Accesibilidad»)","5 business days":"5 días hábiles",". Accessibility reports are triaged with the same priority as functional bugs.":". Los avisos de accesibilidad se priorizan igual que los errores funcionales."},"de":{"Trust & Safety — PollSlide":"Vertrauen und Sicherheit — PollSlide","Our commitment.":"Unser Anspruch.","for the full legal position.":"für die vollständige rechtliche Position.","Profanity filtering.":"Schimpfwortfilter.","Free-text answers, participant display names, and live audience questions are automatically screened against a profanity filter and masked.":"Freitextantworten, Anzeigenamen und Publikumsfragen werden automatisch gegen einen Schimpfwortfilter geprüft und maskiert.","Link & spam filtering.":"Link- und Spamfilter.","Web links are automatically stripped from audience-submitted text and names, reducing spam and phishing risk on the projected screen.":"Weblinks werden automatisch aus Texten und Namen des Publikums entfernt, was Spam- und Phishing-Risiken auf der Leinwand verringert.","Name moderation.":"Namensmoderation.","Display names are filtered for profanity and links; a name that fails moderation is rejected.":"Anzeigenamen werden auf Schimpfwörter und Links geprüft; ein Name, der die Moderation nicht besteht, wird abgelehnt.","Presenter moderation controls.":"Moderationswerkzeuge für Vortragende.","Hosts can hide, mark-answered, remove, and reset audience questions and responses at any time.":"Gastgeber können Publikumsfragen und Antworten jederzeit ausblenden, als beantwortet markieren, entfernen und zurücksetzen.","AI image safety.":"Sicherheit bei KI-Bildern.","AI-generated images run through the provider's safety filter.":"KI-erzeugte Bilder durchlaufen den Sicherheitsfilter des Anbieters.","Flood protection.":"Flutschutz.","Rate limits and per-session caps limit how much any single participant can submit.":"Ratenbegrenzungen und Obergrenzen pro Sitzung beschränken, wie viel eine einzelne Person senden kann.","Minimal data.":"Minimale Daten.","Audience members don't create accounts — they join with a code or QR and provide only a display name and their answers.":"Publikumsmitglieder legen keine Konten an — sie treten mit Code oder QR bei und geben nur einen Anzeigenamen und ihre Antworten an.","Clear data roles.":"Klare Datenrollen.","The presenter is the data controller for their participants' data; PollSlide acts as a processor on their behalf. See our":"Die vortragende Person ist Verantwortliche für die Daten ihrer Teilnehmenden; PollSlide handelt in ihrem Auftrag als Auftragsverarbeiter. Siehe unseren","Sensitive data.":"Sensible Daten.","rules prohibit collecting sensitive personal data without explicit, informed consent.":"verbieten das Erheben sensibler personenbezogener Daten ohne ausdrückliche, informierte Einwilligung.","Your data, recoverable & deletable.":"Deine Daten, wiederherstellbar und löschbar.","Presenters can export their data (CSV) and delete it; resets are snapshotted first so nothing is lost by accident.":"Vortragende können ihre Daten exportieren (CSV) und löschen; vor einem Zurücksetzen wird ein Snapshot angelegt, damit nichts versehentlich verloren geht.","Encryption in transit.":"Verschlüsselung bei der Übertragung.","All traffic uses HTTPS/TLS.":"Der gesamte Verkehr nutzt HTTPS/TLS.","Trusted infrastructure.":"Vertrauenswürdige Infrastruktur.","Authentication and data are handled by Google Firebase; the app is served on Vercel.":"Authentifizierung und Daten übernimmt Google Firebase; die App läuft auf Vercel.","Access controls.":"Zugriffskontrollen.","Team workspaces use role-based permissions; seat limits are enforced server-side.":"Team-Arbeitsbereiche nutzen rollenbasierte Berechtigungen; Platzgrenzen werden serverseitig durchgesetzt.","— harassment, hate, illegal material, spam, or infringement — please report it so we can act:":"— Belästigung, Hass, illegales Material, Spam oder Rechtsverletzungen —, melde es bitte, damit wir handeln können:","Include the session code and a description (and a screenshot if possible). We review reports promptly and may remove content or suspend the session or account responsible.":"Gib den Sitzungscode und eine Beschreibung an (und nach Möglichkeit einen Screenshot). Wir prüfen Meldungen zügig und können Inhalte entfernen oder die verantwortliche Sitzung bzw. das Konto sperren.","PollSlide Technologies LLC ·":"PollSlide Technologies LLC ·","Accessibility Statement — PollSlide":"Erklärung zur Barrierefreiheit — PollSlide","— our marketing and help website.":"— unsere Marketing- und Hilfe-Website.","— the PollSlide web application: the presenter workspace, the participant answer page (":"— die PollSlide-Webanwendung: der Präsentator-Arbeitsbereich, die Antwortseite der Teilnehmenden (","app.pollslide.com/answer":"app.pollslide.com/answer",", reached via QR code or":", erreichbar per QR-Code oder","), live results, reports and shared decks.":"), Live-Ergebnisse, Berichte und geteilte Decks.","— our macOS app, which follows Apple's macOS accessibility frameworks (VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast).":"— unsere macOS-App, die Apples Barrierefreiheits-Frameworks für macOS folgt (VoiceOver, Bewegung reduzieren, Kontrast erhöhen).","Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA":"Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Stufe AA",". WCAG 2.1 AA is the benchmark referenced by the harmonised European standard":". WCAG 2.1 AA ist der Maßstab, auf den die harmonisierte europäische Norm","(which underpins the":"(die dem","European Accessibility Act":"European Accessibility Act",", Directive (EU) 2019/882), by the UK Equality Act 2010 guidance, and by U.S. ADA web-accessibility best practice and Section 508.":", Richtlinie (EU) 2019/882) zugrunde liegt, den Leitlinien des UK Equality Act 2010 sowie den US-amerikanischen ADA-Best-Practices für Web-Barrierefreiheit und Section 508.","Partially conformant.":"Teilweise konform.","Keyboard access:":"Tastaturzugang:","the participant answer flow (join by code, choose an option, type an answer, submit) is operable with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.":"der Antwortablauf der Teilnehmenden (per Code beitreten, Option wählen, Antwort tippen, absenden) ist mit der Tastatur bedienbar, mit sichtbaren Fokusanzeigen.","No forced time limits:":"Keine erzwungenen Zeitlimits:","PollSlide itself does not impose time limits on answering; timing is always under the presenter's control.":"PollSlide selbst setzt keine Zeitlimits fürs Antworten; das Timing liegt immer bei der vortragenden Person.","Zoom and reflow:":"Zoom und Umbruch:","pages use responsive layouts and remain usable at 200% browser zoom; the participant page is a simple single-column layout.":"Seiten nutzen responsive Layouts und bleiben bei 200 % Browserzoom nutzbar; die Teilnehmerseite ist ein einfaches einspaltiges Layout.","Dark and light themes":"Helles und dunkles Design","across the website and apps, respecting your system preference.":"auf der Website und in den Apps, unter Beachtung deiner Systemeinstellung.","Reduced motion:":"Reduzierte Bewegung:","animations (including celebration effects) are disabled for users whose system requests reduced motion.":"Animationen (einschließlich Jubeleffekten) werden für Nutzende deaktiviert, deren System reduzierte Bewegung anfordert.","Multiple languages:":"Mehrere Sprachen:","the participant experience is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese and Italian.":"das Teilnehmererlebnis ist auf Englisch, Spanisch, Deutsch, Französisch, Portugiesisch und Italienisch verfügbar.","Text alternatives to visuals:":"Textalternativen zu visuellen Inhalten:","live results shown as charts are also available as text and numbers, and presenters can export full results as CSV from the report page.":"Live-Ergebnisse, die als Diagramme erscheinen, sind auch als Text und Zahlen verfügbar, und Vortragende können vollständige Ergebnisse auf der Berichtsseite als CSV exportieren.","and enter the session code.":"und gib den Sitzungscode ein.","(subject: \"Accessibility\")":"(Betreff: „Barrierefreiheit“)","5 business days":"5 Werktagen",". Accessibility reports are triaged with the same priority as functional bugs.":". Barrierefreiheitsmeldungen werden mit derselben Priorität behandelt wie funktionale Fehler."},"fr":{"Trust & Safety — PollSlide":"Confiance et sécurité — PollSlide","Our commitment.":"Notre engagement.","for the full legal position.":"pour la position juridique complète.","Profanity filtering.":"Filtrage des grossièretés.","Free-text answers, participant display names, and live audience questions are automatically screened against a profanity filter and masked.":"Les réponses libres, les noms affichés et les questions du public sont automatiquement passés au crible d'un filtre anti-injures puis masqués.","Link & spam filtering.":"Filtrage des liens et du spam.","Web links are automatically stripped from audience-submitted text and names, reducing spam and phishing risk on the projected screen.":"Les liens web sont automatiquement supprimés des textes et noms envoyés par le public, réduisant le risque de spam et d’hameçonnage sur l’écran projeté.","Name moderation.":"Modération des noms.","Display names are filtered for profanity and links; a name that fails moderation is rejected.":"Les noms affichés sont filtrés pour les grossièretés et les liens ; un nom qui échoue à la modération est refusé.","Presenter moderation controls.":"Outils de modération du présentateur.","Hosts can hide, mark-answered, remove, and reset audience questions and responses at any time.":"Les hôtes peuvent masquer, marquer comme répondues, supprimer et réinitialiser les questions et réponses du public à tout moment.","AI image safety.":"Sécurité des images générées par IA.","AI-generated images run through the provider's safety filter.":"Les images générées par IA passent par le filtre de sécurité du fournisseur.","Flood protection.":"Protection contre les envois massifs.","Rate limits and per-session caps limit how much any single participant can submit.":"Des limites de fréquence et des plafonds par session limitent ce qu’un même participant peut envoyer.","Minimal data.":"Données minimales.","Audience members don't create accounts — they join with a code or QR and provide only a display name and their answers.":"Le public ne crée pas de compte — il rejoint avec un code ou un QR et ne fournit qu’un nom affiché et ses réponses.","Clear data roles.":"Rôles clairs sur les données.","The presenter is the data controller for their participants' data; PollSlide acts as a processor on their behalf. See our":"Le présentateur est responsable de traitement pour les données de ses participants ; PollSlide agit comme sous-traitant pour son compte. Consultez notre","Sensitive data.":"Données sensibles.","rules prohibit collecting sensitive personal data without explicit, informed consent.":"interdisent de collecter des données personnelles sensibles sans consentement explicite et éclairé.","Your data, recoverable & deletable.":"Vos données, récupérables et supprimables.","Presenters can export their data (CSV) and delete it; resets are snapshotted first so nothing is lost by accident.":"Les présentateurs peuvent exporter leurs données (CSV) et les supprimer ; les réinitialisations font d’abord l’objet d’un instantané pour que rien ne soit perdu par accident.","Encryption in transit.":"Chiffrement en transit.","All traffic uses HTTPS/TLS.":"Tout le trafic utilise HTTPS/TLS.","Trusted infrastructure.":"Infrastructure de confiance.","Authentication and data are handled by Google Firebase; the app is served on Vercel.":"L’authentification et les données sont gérées par Google Firebase ; l’application est servie sur Vercel.","Access controls.":"Contrôles d’accès.","Team workspaces use role-based permissions; seat limits are enforced server-side.":"Les espaces d’équipe utilisent des permissions par rôle ; les limites de sièges sont appliquées côté serveur.","— harassment, hate, illegal material, spam, or infringement — please report it so we can act:":"— harcèlement, haine, contenu illégal, spam ou contrefaçon —, signalez-le pour que nous puissions agir :","Include the session code and a description (and a screenshot if possible). We review reports promptly and may remove content or suspend the session or account responsible.":"Indiquez le code de session et une description (et une capture d’écran si possible). Nous examinons les signalements rapidement et pouvons retirer du contenu ou suspendre la session ou le compte en cause.","PollSlide Technologies LLC ·":"PollSlide Technologies LLC ·","Accessibility Statement — PollSlide":"Déclaration d’accessibilité — PollSlide","— our marketing and help website.":"— notre site marketing et d’aide.","— the PollSlide web application: the presenter workspace, the participant answer page (":"— l’application web PollSlide : l’espace présentateur, la page de réponse des participants (","app.pollslide.com/answer":"app.pollslide.com/answer",", reached via QR code or":", accessible par QR code ou","), live results, reports and shared decks.":"), les résultats en direct, les rapports et les jeux partagés.","— our macOS app, which follows Apple's macOS accessibility frameworks (VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast).":"— notre application macOS, qui suit les cadres d’accessibilité macOS d’Apple (VoiceOver, Réduire les animations, Augmenter le contraste).","Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA":"Règles pour l’accessibilité des contenus web (WCAG) 2.1, niveau AA",". WCAG 2.1 AA is the benchmark referenced by the harmonised European standard":". WCAG 2.1 AA est la référence utilisée par la norme européenne harmonisée","(which underpins the":"(qui sous-tend la","European Accessibility Act":"Acte européen sur l’accessibilité",", Directive (EU) 2019/882), by the UK Equality Act 2010 guidance, and by U.S. ADA web-accessibility best practice and Section 508.":", directive (UE) 2019/882), par les orientations de l’Equality Act 2010 du Royaume-Uni, et par les bonnes pratiques d’accessibilité web de l’ADA américaine et de la Section 508.","Partially conformant.":"Partiellement conforme.","Keyboard access:":"Accès au clavier :","the participant answer flow (join by code, choose an option, type an answer, submit) is operable with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.":"le parcours de réponse du participant (rejoindre par code, choisir une option, saisir une réponse, envoyer) est utilisable au clavier, avec des indicateurs de focus visibles.","No forced time limits:":"Aucune limite de temps imposée :","PollSlide itself does not impose time limits on answering; timing is always under the presenter's control.":"PollSlide n’impose pas de limite de temps pour répondre ; le rythme est toujours contrôlé par le présentateur.","Zoom and reflow:":"Zoom et redistribution :","pages use responsive layouts and remain usable at 200% browser zoom; the participant page is a simple single-column layout.":"les pages utilisent des mises en page responsives et restent utilisables à 200 % de zoom navigateur ; la page participant est une simple colonne unique.","Dark and light themes":"Thèmes clair et sombre","across the website and apps, respecting your system preference.":"sur le site et dans les applications, en respectant la préférence de votre système.","Reduced motion:":"Animations réduites :","animations (including celebration effects) are disabled for users whose system requests reduced motion.":"les animations (y compris les effets de célébration) sont désactivées pour les personnes dont le système demande des animations réduites.","Multiple languages:":"Plusieurs langues :","the participant experience is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese and Italian.":"l’expérience participant est disponible en anglais, espagnol, allemand, français, portugais et italien.","Text alternatives to visuals:":"Alternatives textuelles aux visuels :","live results shown as charts are also available as text and numbers, and presenters can export full results as CSV from the report page.":"les résultats en direct affichés sous forme de graphiques sont aussi disponibles en texte et en chiffres, et les présentateurs peuvent exporter les résultats complets en CSV depuis la page de rapport.","and enter the session code.":"et saisissez le code de session.","(subject: \"Accessibility\")":"(objet : « Accessibilité »)","5 business days":"5 jours ouvrés",". Accessibility reports are triaged with the same priority as functional bugs.":". Les signalements d’accessibilité sont traités avec la même priorité que les bugs fonctionnels."},"pt":{"Trust & Safety — PollSlide":"Confiança e segurança — PollSlide","Our commitment.":"O nosso compromisso.","for the full legal position.":"para a posição legal completa.","Profanity filtering.":"Filtragem de linguagem ofensiva.","Free-text answers, participant display names, and live audience questions are automatically screened against a profanity filter and masked.":"As respostas de texto livre, os nomes visíveis e as perguntas do público são automaticamente verificados contra um filtro de linguagem imprópria e mascarados.","Link & spam filtering.":"Filtragem de links e spam.","Web links are automatically stripped from audience-submitted text and names, reducing spam and phishing risk on the projected screen.":"Os links web são removidos automaticamente do texto e dos nomes enviados pelo público, reduzindo o risco de spam e phishing no ecrã projetado.","Name moderation.":"Moderação de nomes.","Display names are filtered for profanity and links; a name that fails moderation is rejected.":"Os nomes visíveis são filtrados quanto a linguagem ofensiva e links; um nome que não passe na moderação é rejeitado.","Presenter moderation controls.":"Controlos de moderação do apresentador.","Hosts can hide, mark-answered, remove, and reset audience questions and responses at any time.":"Quem apresenta pode ocultar, marcar como respondidas, remover e repor as perguntas e respostas do público a qualquer momento.","AI image safety.":"Segurança das imagens com IA.","AI-generated images run through the provider's safety filter.":"As imagens geradas por IA passam pelo filtro de segurança do fornecedor.","Flood protection.":"Proteção contra inundação de envios.","Rate limits and per-session caps limit how much any single participant can submit.":"Os limites de frequência e os tetos por sessão limitam quanto cada participante pode enviar.","Minimal data.":"Dados mínimos.","Audience members don't create accounts — they join with a code or QR and provide only a display name and their answers.":"O público não cria contas — entra com um código ou QR e fornece apenas um nome visível e as suas respostas.","Clear data roles.":"Papéis de dados claros.","The presenter is the data controller for their participants' data; PollSlide acts as a processor on their behalf. See our":"Quem apresenta é o responsável pelo tratamento dos dados dos seus participantes; o PollSlide atua como subcontratante em seu nome. Consulte o nosso","Sensitive data.":"Dados sensíveis.","rules prohibit collecting sensitive personal data without explicit, informed consent.":"proíbem a recolha de dados pessoais sensíveis sem consentimento explícito e informado.","Your data, recoverable & deletable.":"Os seus dados, recuperáveis e apagáveis.","Presenters can export their data (CSV) and delete it; resets are snapshotted first so nothing is lost by accident.":"Quem apresenta pode exportar os seus dados (CSV) e apagá-los; antes de repor é criada uma cópia para nada se perder por acidente.","Encryption in transit.":"Encriptação em trânsito.","All traffic uses HTTPS/TLS.":"Todo o tráfego usa HTTPS/TLS.","Trusted infrastructure.":"Infraestrutura de confiança.","Authentication and data are handled by Google Firebase; the app is served on Vercel.":"A autenticação e os dados são geridos pelo Google Firebase; a app é servida na Vercel.","Access controls.":"Controlos de acesso.","Team workspaces use role-based permissions; seat limits are enforced server-side.":"Os espaços de equipa usam permissões por função; os limites de lugares são aplicados no servidor.","— harassment, hate, illegal material, spam, or infringement — please report it so we can act:":"— assédio, ódio, material ilegal, spam ou infração —, denuncie para podermos agir:","Include the session code and a description (and a screenshot if possible). We review reports promptly and may remove content or suspend the session or account responsible.":"Inclua o código da sessão e uma descrição (e uma captura de ecrã se possível). Analisamos as denúncias rapidamente e podemos remover conteúdo ou suspender a sessão ou conta responsável.","PollSlide Technologies LLC ·":"PollSlide Technologies LLC ·","Accessibility Statement — PollSlide":"Declaração de acessibilidade — PollSlide","— our marketing and help website.":"— o nosso site de marketing e ajuda.","— the PollSlide web application: the presenter workspace, the participant answer page (":"— a aplicação web PollSlide: a área do apresentador, a página de resposta do participante (","app.pollslide.com/answer":"app.pollslide.com/answer",", reached via QR code or":", acedida por código QR ou","), live results, reports and shared decks.":"), os resultados em direto, os relatórios e os baralhos partilhados.","— our macOS app, which follows Apple's macOS accessibility frameworks (VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast).":"— a nossa app para macOS, que segue os frameworks de acessibilidade do macOS da Apple (VoiceOver, Reduzir movimento, Aumentar contraste).","Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA":"Diretrizes de Acessibilidade para Conteúdo Web (WCAG) 2.1, nível AA",". WCAG 2.1 AA is the benchmark referenced by the harmonised European standard":". As WCAG 2.1 AA são a referência usada pela norma europeia harmonizada","(which underpins the":"(que sustenta a","European Accessibility Act":"Lei Europeia da Acessibilidade",", Directive (EU) 2019/882), by the UK Equality Act 2010 guidance, and by U.S. ADA web-accessibility best practice and Section 508.":", Diretiva (UE) 2019/882), pelas orientações do Equality Act 2010 do Reino Unido, e pelas boas práticas de acessibilidade web da ADA dos EUA e da Secção 508.","Partially conformant.":"Parcialmente conforme.","Keyboard access:":"Acesso por teclado:","the participant answer flow (join by code, choose an option, type an answer, submit) is operable with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.":"o fluxo de resposta do participante (entrar por código, escolher uma opção, escrever uma resposta, enviar) é operável com teclado, com indicadores de foco visíveis.","No forced time limits:":"Sem limites de tempo forçados:","PollSlide itself does not impose time limits on answering; timing is always under the presenter's control.":"O PollSlide não impõe limites de tempo para responder; o tempo está sempre sob controlo de quem apresenta.","Zoom and reflow:":"Zoom e reformatação:","pages use responsive layouts and remain usable at 200% browser zoom; the participant page is a simple single-column layout.":"as páginas usam layouts responsivos e continuam utilizáveis a 200% de zoom do navegador; a página do participante é de coluna única.","Dark and light themes":"Temas claro e escuro","across the website and apps, respecting your system preference.":"no site e nas apps, respeitando a preferência do seu sistema.","Reduced motion:":"Movimento reduzido:","animations (including celebration effects) are disabled for users whose system requests reduced motion.":"as animações (incluindo efeitos de celebração) são desativadas para quem tem movimento reduzido no sistema.","Multiple languages:":"Vários idiomas:","the participant experience is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese and Italian.":"a experiência do participante está disponível em inglês, espanhol, alemão, francês, português e italiano.","Text alternatives to visuals:":"Alternativas de texto para elementos visuais:","live results shown as charts are also available as text and numbers, and presenters can export full results as CSV from the report page.":"os resultados em direto mostrados em gráficos estão também disponíveis em texto e números, e quem apresenta pode exportar os resultados completos em CSV a partir da página de relatório.","and enter the session code.":"e introduza o código da sessão.","(subject: \"Accessibility\")":"(assunto: «Acessibilidade»)","5 business days":"5 dias úteis",". Accessibility reports are triaged with the same priority as functional bugs.":". Os relatos de acessibilidade são tratados com a mesma prioridade que erros funcionais."},"it":{"Trust & Safety — PollSlide":"Fiducia e sicurezza — PollSlide","Our commitment.":"Il nostro impegno.","for the full legal position.":"per la posizione legale completa.","Profanity filtering.":"Filtro per il turpiloquio.","Free-text answers, participant display names, and live audience questions are automatically screened against a profanity filter and masked.":"Le risposte a testo libero, i nomi visualizzati e le domande del pubblico vengono automaticamente controllati con un filtro anti-volgarità e mascherati.","Link & spam filtering.":"Filtro per link e spam.","Web links are automatically stripped from audience-submitted text and names, reducing spam and phishing risk on the projected screen.":"I link web vengono rimossi automaticamente dai testi e dai nomi inviati dal pubblico, riducendo il rischio di spam e phishing sullo schermo proiettato.","Name moderation.":"Moderazione dei nomi.","Display names are filtered for profanity and links; a name that fails moderation is rejected.":"I nomi visualizzati sono filtrati per turpiloquio e link; un nome che non supera la moderazione viene rifiutato.","Presenter moderation controls.":"Strumenti di moderazione per chi presenta.","Hosts can hide, mark-answered, remove, and reset audience questions and responses at any time.":"Chi ospita può nascondere, segnare come risposte, rimuovere e reimpostare domande e risposte del pubblico in qualsiasi momento.","AI image safety.":"Sicurezza delle immagini generate dall’IA.","AI-generated images run through the provider's safety filter.":"Le immagini generate dall’IA passano dal filtro di sicurezza del fornitore.","Flood protection.":"Protezione contro i flussi eccessivi.","Rate limits and per-session caps limit how much any single participant can submit.":"Limiti di frequenza e tetti per sessione limitano quanto può inviare un singolo partecipante.","Minimal data.":"Dati minimi.","Audience members don't create accounts — they join with a code or QR and provide only a display name and their answers.":"Il pubblico non crea account — entra con un codice o un QR e fornisce solo un nome visualizzato e le proprie risposte.","Clear data roles.":"Ruoli chiari sui dati.","The presenter is the data controller for their participants' data; PollSlide acts as a processor on their behalf. See our":"Chi presenta è titolare del trattamento dei dati dei propri partecipanti; PollSlide agisce come responsabile per suo conto. Vedi il nostro","Sensitive data.":"Dati sensibili.","rules prohibit collecting sensitive personal data without explicit, informed consent.":"vietano la raccolta di dati personali sensibili senza consenso esplicito e informato.","Your data, recoverable & deletable.":"I tuoi dati, recuperabili ed eliminabili.","Presenters can export their data (CSV) and delete it; resets are snapshotted first so nothing is lost by accident.":"Chi presenta può esportare i propri dati (CSV) ed eliminarli; prima di un ripristino viene creata un’istantanea così nulla va perso per errore.","Encryption in transit.":"Crittografia in transito.","All traffic uses HTTPS/TLS.":"Tutto il traffico usa HTTPS/TLS.","Trusted infrastructure.":"Infrastruttura affidabile.","Authentication and data are handled by Google Firebase; the app is served on Vercel.":"Autenticazione e dati sono gestiti da Google Firebase; l’app è servita su Vercel.","Access controls.":"Controlli di accesso.","Team workspaces use role-based permissions; seat limits are enforced server-side.":"Gli spazi di squadra usano permessi per ruolo; i limiti di postazioni sono applicati lato server.","— harassment, hate, illegal material, spam, or infringement — please report it so we can act:":"— molestie, odio, materiale illegale, spam o violazioni —, segnalalo così possiamo intervenire:","Include the session code and a description (and a screenshot if possible). We review reports promptly and may remove content or suspend the session or account responsible.":"Indica il codice della sessione e una descrizione (e uno screenshot se possibile). Esaminiamo le segnalazioni rapidamente e possiamo rimuovere contenuti o sospendere la sessione o l’account responsabile.","PollSlide Technologies LLC ·":"PollSlide Technologies LLC ·","Accessibility Statement — PollSlide":"Dichiarazione di accessibilità — PollSlide","— our marketing and help website.":"— il nostro sito di marketing e assistenza.","— the PollSlide web application: the presenter workspace, the participant answer page (":"— l’applicazione web PollSlide: lo spazio del presentatore, la pagina di risposta dei partecipanti (","app.pollslide.com/answer":"app.pollslide.com/answer",", reached via QR code or":", raggiungibile tramite codice QR o","), live results, reports and shared decks.":"), i risultati dal vivo, i report e i mazzi condivisi.","— our macOS app, which follows Apple's macOS accessibility frameworks (VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast).":"— la nostra app per macOS, che segue i framework di accessibilità macOS di Apple (VoiceOver, Riduci movimento, Aumenta contrasto).","Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA":"Linee guida per l’accessibilità dei contenuti web (WCAG) 2.1, livello AA",". WCAG 2.1 AA is the benchmark referenced by the harmonised European standard":". WCAG 2.1 AA è il riferimento utilizzato dalla norma europea armonizzata","(which underpins the":"(che è alla base della","European Accessibility Act":"Atto europeo sull’accessibilità",", Directive (EU) 2019/882), by the UK Equality Act 2010 guidance, and by U.S. ADA web-accessibility best practice and Section 508.":", direttiva (UE) 2019/882), dalle linee guida dell’Equality Act 2010 del Regno Unito, e dalle buone pratiche di accessibilità web dell’ADA statunitense e della Section 508.","Partially conformant.":"Parzialmente conforme.","Keyboard access:":"Accesso da tastiera:","the participant answer flow (join by code, choose an option, type an answer, submit) is operable with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.":"il flusso di risposta del partecipante (entrare col codice, scegliere un’opzione, digitare una risposta, inviare) è utilizzabile da tastiera, con indicatori di focus visibili.","No forced time limits:":"Nessun limite di tempo imposto:","PollSlide itself does not impose time limits on answering; timing is always under the presenter's control.":"PollSlide di per sé non impone limiti di tempo per rispondere; i tempi sono sempre sotto il controllo di chi presenta.","Zoom and reflow:":"Zoom e riadattamento:","pages use responsive layouts and remain usable at 200% browser zoom; the participant page is a simple single-column layout.":"le pagine usano layout responsive e restano utilizzabili al 200% di zoom del browser; la pagina del partecipante è a colonna singola.","Dark and light themes":"Temi chiaro e scuro","across the website and apps, respecting your system preference.":"sul sito e nelle app, rispettando la preferenza del tuo sistema.","Reduced motion:":"Movimento ridotto:","animations (including celebration effects) are disabled for users whose system requests reduced motion.":"le animazioni (compresi gli effetti di celebrazione) sono disattivate per chi ha impostato il movimento ridotto nel sistema.","Multiple languages:":"Più lingue:","the participant experience is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese and Italian.":"l’esperienza del partecipante è disponibile in inglese, spagnolo, tedesco, francese, portoghese e italiano.","Text alternatives to visuals:":"Alternative testuali ai contenuti visivi:","live results shown as charts are also available as text and numbers, and presenters can export full results as CSV from the report page.":"i risultati dal vivo mostrati come grafici sono disponibili anche come testo e numeri, e chi presenta può esportare i risultati completi in CSV dalla pagina del report.","and enter the session code.":"e inserisci il codice della sessione.","(subject: \"Accessibility\")":"(oggetto: «Accessibilità»)","5 business days":"5 giorni lavorativi",". Accessibility reports are triaged with the same priority as functional bugs.":". Le segnalazioni di accessibilità sono trattate con la stessa priorità dei bug funzionali."}});

